ID   1.1.1.3
DE   homoserine dehydrogenase.
CA   (1) L-homoserine + NAD(+) = L-aspartate 4-semialdehyde + NADH + H(+).
CA   (2) L-homoserine + NADP(+) = L-aspartate 4-semialdehyde + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme from Saccharomyces cerevisiae acts most rapidly with
CC       NAD(+); the Neurospora enzyme with NADP(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme from Escherichia coli is a multifunctional protein, which
CC       also catalyzes the reaction of EC 2.7.2.4.
DR   P00561, AK1H_ECOLI ;  P27725, AK1H_SERMA ;  P00562, AK2H_ECOLI ;
