ID   1.1.1.40
DE   malate dehydrogenase (oxaloacetate-decarboxylating) (NADP(+)).
AN   malic enzyme.
AN   NADP-malic enzyme.
AN   pyruvic-malic carboxylase.
CA   (1) (S)-malate + NADP(+) = pyruvate + CO2 + NADPH.
CA   (2) oxaloacetate + H(+) = pyruvate + CO2.
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes the oxidative decarboxylation of (S)-malate in
