ID   1.1.1.62
DE   17beta-estradiol 17-dehydrogenase.
AN   17beta-estradiol dehydrogenase.
AN   17beta-HSD.
AN   17beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase.
AN   20alpha-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase.
AN   estrogen 17-oxidoreductase.
CA   (1) 17beta-estradiol + NAD(+) = estrone + NADH + H(+).
CA   (2) 17beta-estradiol + NADP(+) = estrone + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme oxidizes or reduces the hydroxy/keto group on C17 of
CC       estrogens and androgens in mammals and regulates the biological
CC       potency of these steroids.
CC   -!- The mammalian enzyme is bifunctional and also catalyzes EC 1.1.1.270.
CC   -!- The enzyme also acts on (S)-20-hydroxypregn-4-en-3-one and related
CC       compounds, oxidizing the (S)-20-group, but unlike EC 1.1.1.149, it is
CC       Si-specific with respect to NAD(P)(+).
