DE   aryl-alcohol dehydrogenase.
AN   benzyl alcohol dehydrogenase.
AN   p-hydroxybenzyl alcohol dehydrogenase.
CA   an aromatic primary alcohol + NAD(+) = an aromatic aldehyde + NADH +
