//
ID   1.1.1.92
DE   oxaloglycolate reductase (decarboxylating).
CA   (1) (R)-glycerate + CO2 + NAD(+) = 2-hydroxy-3-oxosuccinate + NADH +
CA   2 H(+).
CA   (2) (R)-glycerate + CO2 + NADP(+) = 2-hydroxy-3-oxosuccinate + NADPH +
CA   2 H(+).
CC   -!- Also reduces hydroxypyruvate to D-glycerate and glyoxylate to
CC       glycolate.
