DE   glycerol-3-phosphate dehydrogenase [NAD(P)(+)].
AN   glycerol 3-phosphate dehydrogenase (NAD(P)).
AN   glycerol 3-phosphate dehydrogenase (NADP).
AN   glycerol phosphate dehydrogenase (nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide
AN   (phosphate)).
AN   L-glycerol-3-phosphate:NAD(P) oxidoreductase.
CA   (1) sn-glycerol 3-phosphate + NAD(+) = dihydroxyacetone phosphate + NADH
CA   + H(+).
CA   (2) sn-glycerol 3-phosphate + NADP(+) = dihydroxyacetone phosphate +
CA   NADPH + H(+).
