CA   dihydroxyphenyl)pyruvate + NADH + H(+).
CA   (4) (2R)-3-(3,4-dihydroxyphenyl)lactate + NADP(+) = 3-(3,4-
CA   dihydroxyphenyl)pyruvate + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme participates in the biosynthesis of rosmarinic acid.
