ID   1.1.1.286
DE   isocitrate--homoisocitrate dehydrogenase.
AN   homoisocitrate--isocitrate dehydrogenase.
CA   (1) D-threo-isocitrate + NAD(+) = 2-oxoglutarate + CO2 + NADH.
CA   (2) (2R,3S)-homoisocitrate + NAD(+) = 2-oxoadipate + CO2 + NADH.
