DE   2-hydroxymethylglutarate dehydrogenase.
CA   (S)-2-hydroxymethylglutarate + NAD(+) = 2-formylglutarate + NADH + H(+).
CC   -!- NADP(+) cannot replace NAD(+).
CC   -!- Forms part of the nicotinate-fermentation catabolism pathway in
CC       Eubacterium barkeri.
CC   -!- Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.1.5, EC 1.3.7.1,
CC       EC 3.5.2.18, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6, EC 4.2.1.85 and EC 4.1.3.32.
