DR   Q3L181, PERR_RAUSE ;
//
ID   1.1.1.318
DE   eugenol synthase.
AN   EGS2.
CA   eugenol + a carboxylate + NADP(+) = a coniferyl ester + NADPH.
CC   -!- The enzyme acts in the opposite direction.
