CC       breweri and Petunia hybrida only accept coniferyl acetate and form
CC       eugenol.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Pimpinella anisum (anise) forms anol (from 4-coumaryl
CC       acetate) in vivo, although the recombinant enzyme can form eugenol
