CC       'propeller' structure, a calcium ion bound to the PQQ in the active
CC       site and an unusual disulfide ring structure in close proximity to
CC       the PQQ.
CC   -!- It differs from EC 1.1.2.8, alcohol dehydrogenase (cytochrome c),
CC       in having a high affinity for methanol and in having a second
CC       essential small subunit (no known function).
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.1.99.8.
