CC       domain has an 8-bladed 'propeller' structure.
CC   -!- It occurs in a wide range of bacteria.
CC   -!- Catalyzes a direct oxidation of the pyranose form of D-glucose to the
CC       lactone and thence to D-gluconate in the periplasm.
