ID   1.2.3.15
DE   (methyl)glyoxal oxidase.
CA   (1) glyoxal + O2 + H2O = glyoxylate + H2O2 + H(+).
CA   (2) methylglyoxal + O2 + H2O = pyruvate + H2O2 + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, originally characterized from the white rot fungus
CC       Phanerochaete chrysosporium, utilizes a free radical-coupled copper
CC       complex for catalysis.
DR   Q01772, GLOX_PHACH ;
