AN   glyceraldehyde-3-phosphate Fd oxidoreductase.
AN   glyceraldehyde-3-phosphate ferredoxin reductase.
CA   D-glyceraldehyde 3-phosphate + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + H2O =
CA   (2R)-3-phosphoglycerate + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + 3 H(+).
