CC       enzymes that reversibly catalyze the oxidative decarboxylation of
CC       different 2-oxoacids to form their CoA derivatives, and are
CC       differentiated based on their substrate specificity.
CC   -!- For examples of other members of this family, see EC 1.2.7.1 and
