ID   1.3.1.86
DE   crotonyl-CoA reductase.
AN   3-hydroxyacyl CoA reductase.
AN   butyryl-CoA dehydrogenase.
AN   enoyl-coenzyme A reductase.
AN   ethylene reductase.
AN   short-chain acyl-coenzyme A dehydrogenase.
AN   unsaturated acyl coenzyme A reductase.
CA   butanoyl-CoA + NADP(+) = (2E)-butenoyl-CoA + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the reaction in the reverse direction.
CC   -!- This enzyme from Streptomyces collinus is specific for (E)-but-2-
CC       enoyl-CoA, and is proposed to provide butanoyl-CoA as a starter unit
CC       for straight-chain fatty acid biosynthesis.
DR   Q82LU9, CCR_STRAW  ;  Q53865, CCR_STRCU  ;  Q5EU90, TER_EUGGR  ;
