AN   DGGGPL reductase.
AN   digeranylgeranylglycerophospholipid reductase.
CA   (1) 2,3-bis-O-(phytanyl)-sn-glycerol 1-phosphate + 8 NADP(+) = 2,3-bis-O-
CA   (geranylgeranyl)-sn-glycerol 1-phosphate + 8 NADPH + 8 H(+).
CA   (2) 2,3-bis-O-(phytanyl)-sn-glycerol 1-phosphate + 8 NAD(+) = 2,3-bis-O-
CA   (geranylgeranyl)-sn-glycerol 1-phosphate + 8 NADH + 8 H(+).
