ID   1.3.1.106
DE   cobalt-precorrin-6A reductase.
CA   Co-precorrin-6B + NAD(+) = Co-precorrin-6A + NADH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, which participates in the anaerobic (early cobalt
CC       insertion) pathway of adenosylcobalamin biosynthesis, catalyzes the
CC       reduction of the double bond between C-18 and C-19 of cobalt-
CC       precorrin-6A.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the bacterium Bacillus megaterium has no activity
CC       with NADPH.
CC   -!- See EC 1.3.1.54 for the corresponding enzyme that participates in the
