DE   7-epi-iridoid synthase.
CA   (R)-8-oxocitronellyl enol + NADP(+) = (6E)-8-oxogeranial + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the plant Antirrhinum majus
CC       (snapdragon), is involved in biosynthesis of 7-epi-iridoids such as
