CA   + NADP(+).
CA   (2) a (2E,4Z)-dienoyl-CoA + NADPH + H(+) = a 4,5-saturated-(3E)-enoyl-CoA
CA   + NADP(+).
CC   -!- This enzyme, characterized from eukaryotic organisms, catalyzes the
CC       reduction of either (2E,4E)-2,4-dienoyl-CoA or (2E,4Z)-2,4-dienoyl-
CC       CoA to (3E)-3-enoyl-CoA.
CC   -!- The best substrates for the enzyme from bovine liver have a chain-
