DE   protoporphyrinogen IX dehydrogenase (quinone).
AN   protoporphyrinogen IX dehydrogenase (menaquinone).
CA   protoporphyrinogen IX + 3 a quinone = protoporphyrin IX + 3 a quinol.
CC   -!- Contains FMN.
