ID   1.3.5.5
DE   15-cis-phytoene desaturase.
AN   PDS.
AN   phytoene desaturase.
AN   plant-type phytoene desaturase.
CA   2 a plastoquinone + 15-cis-phytoene = 9,9',15-tri-cis-zeta-carotene + 2 a
CA   plastoquinol.
CC   -!- This enzyme is involved in carotenoid biosynthesis in plants and
CC       cyanobacteria.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Synechococcus can also use NAD(+) and NADP(+) as
CC       electron acceptor under anaerobic conditions.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Gentiana lutea shows no activity with NAD(+) or
CC       NADP(+).
