DE   6-hydroxynicotinate reductase.
AN   6-hydroxynicotinic reductase.
AN   6-oxotetrahydro-nicotinate dehydrogenase.
AN   HNA reductase.
CA   1,4,5,6-tetrahydro-6-oxonicotinate + oxidized 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] =
CA   6-hydroxynicotinate + reduced 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- Forms part of the nicotinate-fermentation catabolism pathway in
CC       Eubacterium barkeri.
CC   -!- Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.5.1, EC 3.5.2.18,
CC       EC 1.1.1.291, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6, EC 4.2.1.85 and EC 4.1.3.32.
DR   Q0QLF7, HNR_EUBBA  ;
