ID   1.3.7.2
DE   15,16-dihydrobiliverdin:ferredoxin oxidoreductase.
CA   15,16-dihydrobiliverdin + oxidized 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] = biliverdin
CA   IXalpha + reduced 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the two-electron reduction of biliverdin IXalpha at the C15
CC       methine bridge.
CC   -!- It has been proposed that this enzyme and EC 1.3.7.3 function as a
CC       dual enzyme complex in the conversion of biliverdin IXalpha into
CC       phycoerythrobilin.
