ID   1.3.7.3
DE   phycoerythrobilin:ferredoxin oxidoreductase.
CA   (3Z)-phycoerythrobilin + oxidized 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] = 15,16-
CA   dihydrobiliverdin + reduced 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the two-electron reduction of the C2 and C3(1) diene system
CC       of 15,16-dihydrobiliverdin.
CC   -!- Specific for 15,16-dihydrobiliverdin.
CC   -!- It has been proposed that this enzyme and EC 1.3.7.2 function as a
CC       dual enzyme complex in the conversion of biliverdin IXalpha into
CC       phycoerythrobilin.
DR   Q7NL65, PEBB_GLOVI ;  Q93TM8, PEBB_NOSP7 ;  Q7U4P6, PEBB_PARMW ;
