ID   1.3.7.11
DE   2,3-bis-O-geranylgeranyl-sn-glycero-phospholipid reductase.
AN   2,3-bis-O-geranylgeranyl-sn-glycerol 1-phosphate reductase (donor).
CA   a 2,3-bis-O-phytanyl-sn-glycerol 1-phospholipid + 8 oxidized 2[4Fe-4S]-
CA   [ferredoxin] = a 2,3-bis-O-(geranylgeranyl)-sn-glycerol 1-phospholipid +
CA   8 reduced 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] + 16 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of archaeal membrane
CC       lipids.
CC   -!- It catalyzes the reduction of all 8 double bonds in 2,3-bis-O-
CC       geranylgeranyl-sn-glycero-phospholipids and all 4 double bonds in
CC       3-O-geranylgeranyl-sn-glycerol phospholipids with comparable
CC       activity.
CC   -!- Unlike EC 1.3.1.101, this enzyme shows no activity with NADPH,
CC       and requires a dedicated ferredoxin.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.3.99.34.
DR   Q12YW2, GGR1_METBU ;  Q12WF0, GGR2_METBU ;  Q8TQQ6, GGR_METAC  ;
DR   Q0W349, GGR_METAR  ;  A7I9P9, GGR_METB6  ;  Q465Z7, GGR_METBF  ;
DR   Q2FUA4, GGR_METHJ  ;  A2SQK1, GGR_METLZ  ;  Q8PU50, GGR_METMA  ;
DR   A3CST9, GGR_METMJ  ;  B8GGQ9, GGR_METPE  ;  A0B573, GGR_METTP  ;
