DE   4,4'-diapophytoene desaturase (4,4'-diapolycopene-forming).
AN   4,4'-diapophytoene desaturase.
AN   dehydrosqualene desaturase.
CA   15-cis-4,4'-diapophytoene + 4 FAD + 4 H(+) = all-trans-4,4'-diapolycopene
CA   + 4 FADH2.
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes four successive dehydrogenations, resulting in
CC       production of 4,4'-diapolycopene.
CC   -!- While the enzyme from Staphylococcus aureus was only shown to produce
CC       4,4'-diaponeurosporene in vivo, it is able to catalyze the last
CC       reaction in vitro.
