AN   2-methyl branched chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenase.
AN   2-methyl-branched-chain-enoyl-CoA reductase.
AN   branched-chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenase.
CA   2-methylbutanoyl-CoA + oxidized [electron-transfer flavoprotein] + H(+) =
CA   (2E)-2-methylbut-2-enoyl-CoA + reduced [electron-transfer flavoprotein].
CC   -!- The mammalian enzyme catalyzes an oxidative reaction as a step in the
