CC       enzyme's [4Fe-4S] cluster to split AdoMet into methionine and the
CC       radical 5'-deoxyadenosin-5'-yl; this radical initiates attack on the
CC       2-carboxyethyl groups, leading to their conversion into vinyl groups.
CC   -!- This conversion, -.CH-CH2-COO- -> -CH=CH2 + CO2 + e(-) replaces the
CC       electron initially used.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.3.99.22.
