AN   anabolic L-arginine dehydrogenase.
CA   (1) L-arginine + NAD(+) + H2O = 5-guanidino-2-oxopentanoate + NH4(+) +
CA   NADH + H(+).
CA   (2) L-arginine + NADP(+) + H2O = 5-guanidino-2-oxopentanoate + NH4(+) +
CA   NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, which has been isolated from the bacterium Pseudomonas
CC       aeruginosa PAO1, forms with EC 1.4.99.6 a two-enzyme complex involved
CC       in the racemization of D- and L-arginine.
