CA   pseudooxynicotine + 2 Fe(III)-[cytochrome c] + H2O = 4-oxo-4-(pyridin-3-
CA   yl)butanal + methylamine + 2 Fe(II)-[cytochrome c] + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- Contains one non-covalently bound FAD molecule per dimer.
CC   -!- This enzyme, characterized from the soil bacteria Pseudomonas sp.
CC       HZN6, and Pseudomonas putida S16, is involved in nicotine
CC       degradation.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.4.3.24.
DR   F8G0P1, PNAO_PSEP6 ;  H8ZPX1, PNAO_PSESP ;
