ID   1.4.3.7
DE   D-glutamate oxidase.
AN   D-glutamic oxidase.
CA   D-glutamate + O2 + H2O = 2-oxoglutarate + H2O2 + NH4(+).
//
ID   1.4.3.8
DE   ethanolamine oxidase.
CA   ethanolamine + O2 + H2O = glycolaldehyde + H2O2 + NH4(+).
//
