ID   1.4.3.10
DE   putrescine oxidase.
CA   putrescine + O2 + H2O = 4-aminobutanal + H2O2 + NH4(+).
CC   -!- 4-aminobutanal condenses non-enzymically to 1-pyrroline.
DR   P40974, PUO_KOCRO  ;
//
ID   1.4.3.11
DE   L-glutamate oxidase.
CA   L-glutamate + O2 + H2O = 2-oxoglutarate + H2O2 + NH4(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme from Azotobacter previously listed under this number,
CC       which did not produce H2O2, was a crude cell-free extract which
CC       probably contained catalase.
DR   S4S6Z0, LAAO4_HEBCY;  A0A1B1PF34, LGOX_STRDA ;  Q8L3C7, LGOX_STRSQ ;
