ID   1.5.1.21
DE   1-piperideine-2-carboxylate/1-pyrroline-2-carboxylate reductase (NADPH).
AN   Delta(1)-piperideine-2-carboxylate reductase.
AN   Pyr2C reductase.
CA   (1) L-pipecolate + NADP(+) = Delta(1)-piperideine-2-carboxylate + NADPH +
CA   H(+).
CA   (2) L-proline + NADP(+) = 1-pyrroline-2-carboxylate + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the catabolism of D-lysine and D-proline in
CC       bacteria that belong to the Pseudomonas genus.
CC   -!- In contrast to EC 1.5.1.1, which shows similar activity with NADPH
CC       and NADH, this enzyme is specific for NADPH.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.5.1.14.
DR   Q9I492, PY2CR_PSEAE;  Q5FB93, PY2CR_PSEPU;  Q4U331, PY2CR_PSEUB;
