CA   (2) (3R)-1,4-thiomorpholine-3-carboxylate + NAD(+) = 3,4-
CA   dehydrothiomorpholine-3-carboxylate + NADH + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The product is the cyclic imine of the 2-oxoacid corresponding to
