DE   1,2-dehydroreticulinium reductase (NADPH).
AN   1,2-dehydroreticulinium ion reductase.
CA   (R)-reticuline + NADP(+) = 1,2-dehydroreticuline + NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- Reduces the 1,2-dehydroreticulinium ion to (R)-reticuline, which is a
