CC   -!- L-aspartate 4-semialdehyde and propane-1,3-diamine/putrescine form a
CC       Schiff base that is reduced to form
CC       carboxynorspermidine/carboxyspermidine, respectively.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the bacterium Vibrio cholerae is essential for
CC       biofilm formation.
