ID   1.5.3.16
DE   spermine oxidase.
AN   SMO.
CA   spermine + O2 + H2O = 3-aminopropanal + spermidine + H2O2.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Arabidopsis thaliana (AtPAO1) oxidizes norspermine to
