ID   1.5.3.20
DE   N-alkylglycine oxidase.
AN   N-carboxymethylalkylamine:oxygen oxidoreductase (decarboxymethylating).
CA   an N-alkylglycine + O2 + H2O = an alkylamine + glyoxylate + H2O2.
CC   -!- Isolated from the mold Cladosporium sp. G-10.
