CC       on 2-aminoethylphosphonate, generating phosphonoacetaldehyde and
CC       ammonia.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Acinetobacter baumannii also transformed
CC       2-(dimethylaminoethyl)phosphonate with appreciable efficiency,
CC       generating dimethylamine in place of methylamine.
