ID   1.6.2.6
DE   leghemoglobin reductase.
CA   (1) 2 Fe(III)-[leghemoglobin] + NADPH = 2 Fe(II)-[leghemoglobin] +
CA   NADP(+) + H(+).
CA   (2) 2 Fe(III)-[leghemoglobin] + NADH = 2 Fe(II)-[leghemoglobin] + NAD(+)
CA   + H(+).
