DE   NAD(P)H dehydrogenase (quinone).
AN   azoreductase.
AN   dehydrogenase, reduced nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (phosphate,
AN   quinone).
AN   diaphorase.
AN   DT-diaphorase.
AN   flavoprotein NAD(P)H-quinone reductase.
AN   menadione oxidoreductase.
