CA   (1) a quinone + NADH + H(+) = a quinol + NAD(+).
CA   (2) a quinone + NADPH + H(+) = a quinol + NADP(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a two-electron reduction and has a preference
CC       for short-chain acceptor quinones, such as ubiquinone, benzoquinone,
