ID   1.7.7.1
DE   ferredoxin--nitrite reductase.
CA   6 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + NH4(+) + 2 H2O = nitrite + 6 reduced
CA   [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + 8 H(+).
