ID   1.8.1.13
DE   bis-gamma-glutamylcystine reductase.
AN   bis-gamma-glutamylcystine reductase (NADPH).
AN   NADPH:bis-gamma-glutamylcysteine oxidoreductase.
CA   2 gamma-L-glutamyl-L-cysteine + NADP(+) = bis-gamma-glutamylcystine +
CA   NADPH + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, which is found only in halobacteria, maintains the
CC       concentration of gamma-glutamylcysteine, the major low molecular
CC       weight thiol in halobacteria.
CC   -!- Not identical with EC 1.8.1.7 or EC 1.8.1.14.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.6.4.9.
