CC   -!- Not identical with EC 1.8.1.6, EC 1.8.1.7 or EC 1.8.1.13.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the bacterium Staphylococcus aureus has a strong
CC       preference for NADPH, while the bacterium Bacillus megaterium
CC       contains both NADH and NADPH-dependent enzymes.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.6.4.10.
