//
ID   1.8.2.4
DE   dimethyl sulfide:cytochrome c2 reductase.
CA   2 Fe(III)-[cytochrome c2] + dimethyl sulfide + H2O = 2 Fe(II)-[cytochrome
CA   c2] + dimethyl sulfoxide + 2 H(+).
