DE   L-methionine (S)-S-oxide reductase.
AN   acetylmethionine sulfoxide reductase.
AN   free-methionine (S)-S-oxide reductase.
AN   fSMsr.
AN   methionine-S-oxide reductase.
AN   methionine sulfoxide reductase.
