ID   1.8.5.2
DE   thiosulfate dehydrogenase (quinone).
AN   thiosulfate:quinone oxidoreductase.
AN   thiosulfate oxidoreductase, tetrathionate-forming.
AN   TQO.
CA   6-decylubiquinone + 2 thiosulfate = 6-decylubiquinol + tetrathionate.
CC   -!- The reaction can also proceed with ferricyanide as the electron
CC       acceptor, but more slowly.
CC   -!- Unlike EC 1.8.2.2, this enzyme cannot utilize cytochrome c as an
CC       acceptor.
DR   P97224, DOXA_ACIAM ;  P97207, DOXD_ACIAM ;
