CC       strain CA10 also accepts 2'-aminobiphenyl-2,3-diol.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Ralstonia sp. SBUG 290 can also accept 1,2-
CC       dihydroxydibenzofuran and 1,2-dihydroxynaphthalene.
CC   -!- The enzyme is strongly inhibited by the substrate.
CC   -!- Not identical with EC 1.13.11.2.
