ID   1.13.11.55
DE   sulfur oxygenase/reductase.
AN   sulfur oxygenase.
AN   sulfur oxygenase reductase.
CA   4 sulfur + O2 + 4 H2O = 2 hydrogen sulfide + 2 sulfite + 6 H(+).
CC   -!- Elemental sulfur is both the electron donor and one of the two known
CC       acceptors, the other being oxygen.
CC   -!- Thiosulfate is also observed as a product, but is likely formed non-
CC       enzymically by a reaction between sulfite and sulfur.
CC   -!- This enzyme differs from EC 1.13.11.18 and EC 1.12.98.4 in that both
CC       activities occur simultaneously.
DR   P29082, SOR_ACIAM  ;
