CC       transcriptional activation domain of HIF-alpha, the alpha subunit of
CC       the transcriptional regulator HIF (hypoxia-inducible factor), which
CC       reduces its interaction with the transcriptional coactivator protein
CC       p300.
CC   -!- The requirement of oxygen for the hydroxylation reaction enables
CC       animals to respond to hypoxia.
