CA   a 2-halobenzoate + NADH + O2 + H(+) = a halide anion + catechol + CO2 +
CA   NAD(+).
CC   -!- A multicomponent enzyme system composed of a dioxygenase component
CC       and an electron transfer component.
CC   -!- The latter contains FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Burkholderia cepacia
CC       2CBS, has a broad substrate specificity.
CC   -!- Substrates include 2-fluorobenzoate, 2-chlorobenzoate,
CC       2-bromobenzoate, and 2-iodobenzoate, which are processed in this
CC       order of preference.
