CA   biphenyl + NADH + O2 + H(+) = (2R,3S)-3-phenylcyclohexa-3,5-diene-1,2-
CA   diol + NAD(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme from Burkholderia fungorum strain LB400 (previously
CC       Pseudomonas sp.) is part of a multicomponent system composed of an
CC       NADH:ferredoxin oxidoreductase (FAD cofactor), a [2Fe-2S] Rieske-type
CC       ferredoxin, and a terminal oxygenase that contains a [2Fe-2S] Rieske-
CC       type iron-sulfur cluster and a catalytic mononuclear nonheme iron
CC       center.
CC   -!- Chlorine-substituted biphenyls can also act as substrates.
CC   -!- Similar to the three-component enzyme systems EC 1.14.12.3 and
CC       EC 1.14.12.11.
