DE   magnesium-protoporphyrin IX monomethyl ester (oxidative) cyclase.
AN   Mg-protoporphyrin IX monomethyl ester oxidative cyclase.
CA   Mg-protoporphyrin IX 13-monomethyl ester + 3 NADPH + 3 O2 + 2 H(+) = 3,8-
CA   divinyl protochlorophyllide a + 3 NADP(+) + 5 H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme participates in the biosynthesis of chlorophyllide a in
CC       aerobic organisms.
CC   -!- The same transformation is achieved in anaerobic organisms by
CC       EC 1.21.98.3.
CC   -!- Some facultative phototrophic bacteria, such as Rubrivivax
CC       gelatinosus, possess both enzymes.
