ID   1.14.13.113
DE   FAD-dependent urate hydroxylase.
AN   FAD-dependent urate oxidase.
AN   urate hydroxylase.
CA   urate + NADH + O2 + H(+) = 5-hydroxyisourate + NAD(+) + H2O.
CC   -!- The reaction is part of the purine catabolic pathway in the bacterium
CC       Klebsiella pneumoniae.
CC   -!- The enzyme is different from EC 1.7.3.3, found in most plants, which
CC       produces hydrogen peroxide.
CC   -!- The product of the enzyme is a substrate for EC 3.5.2.17.
DR   Q6F6Y2, HPXO_ACIAD ;  B5B0J6, HPXO_KLEOX ;  A6T923, HPXO_KLEP7 ;
DR   B6D1N4, HPXO_KLEPN ;  A1TFU9, HPXO_MYCVP ;  Q8PDQ6, HPYO_XANCP ;
//
