DE   chlorophyllide a oxygenase.
AN   CAO.
AN   cholorophyll-b synthase.
CA   chlorophyllide a + 2 NADPH + 2 O2 + 2 H(+) = chlorophyllide b + 2 NADP(+)
CA   + 3 H2O.
CC   -!- Catalyzes two successive hydroxylations at the 7-methyl group of
CC       chlorophyllide a.
CC   -!- The second step yields the aldehyde hydrate, which loses H2O
CC       spontaneously to form chlorophyllide b.
CC   -!- Chlorophyll a and protochlorophyllide a are not substrates.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.13.12.14.
DR   Q9MBA1, CAO_ARATH  ;  Q9ZWM5, CAO_CHLRE  ;  Q9XJ38, CAO_DUNSA  ;
DR   Q8S7E1, CAO_ORYSJ  ;
