DE   7-methylxanthine demethylase.
CA   (1) 7-methylxanthine + NADPH + O2 + H(+) = xanthine + formaldehyde +
CA   NADP(+) + H2O.
CA   (2) 7-methylxanthine + NADH + O2 + H(+) = xanthine + formaldehyde +
CA   NAD(+) + H2O.
