AN   OTEMO.
CA   [(1R)-2,2,3-trimethyl-5-oxocyclopent-3-enyl]acetyl-CoA + NADPH + O2 +
CA   H(+) = [(2R)-3,3,4-trimethyl-6-oxo-3,6-dihydro-1H-pyran-2-yl]acetyl-CoA +
