DE   L-evernosamine nitrososynthase.
CA   dTDP-beta-L-evernosamine + 2 NADPH + 2 O2 + H(+) = dTDP-2,3,6-trideoxy-3-
CA   C-methyl-4-O-methyl-3-nitroso-beta-L-arabino-hexopyranose + 2 NADP(+) +
CA   3 H2O.
CC   -!- Isolated from the bacterium Micromonospora carbonacea var. africana.
CC   -!- The nitroso group is probably spontaneously oxidized to a nitro group
