ID   1.14.13.n6
DE   hexahomomethionine N-hydroxylase.
CA   (1) hexahomomethionine + 2 O2 + 2 NADPH + 2 H(+) =
CA   9-methylthiononanaldoxime + 3 H2O + CO2 + NADP(+).
CA   (2) pentahomomethionine + 2 O2 + 2 NADPH + 2 H(+) =
CA   8-methylthiooctanaldoxime + 3 H2O + CO2 + NADP(+).
