DE   phenol 2-monooxygenase (FADH2).
CA   phenol + FADH2 + O2 = catechol + FAD + H2O + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes the ortho-hydroxylation of simple phenols into
CC       the corresponding catechols.
CC   -!- It accepts 4-methylphenol, 4-chlorophenol, and 4-fluorophenol as well
CC       as 4-nitrophenol, 3-nitrophenol, and resorcinol.
CC   -!- The enzyme is part of a two-component system that also includes an
CC       NADH-dependent flavin reductase. cf. EC 1.14.13.7.
CC   -!- It is strictly dependent on FADH2 and does not accept FMNH2.
