CA   (E)-4-hydroxyphenylacetaldehyde oxime + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein
CA   reductase] + O2 = (S)-4-hydroxymandelonitrile + oxidized [NADPH-
CA   -hemoprotein reductase] + 2 H2O + H(+).
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of the cyanogenic glucoside dhurrin in
CC       sorghum.
CC   -!- It catalyzes three different activities - isomerization of the (E)
CC       isomer to the (Z) isomer, dehydration, and C-hydroxylation.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.13.68.
DR   O48958, C71E1_SORBI;
