DE   phenylacetaldehyde oxime monooxygenase.
AN   CYP71AN24.
CA   (E)-phenylacetaldehyde oxime + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] +
CA   O2 = (R)-mandelonitrile + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] + 2 H2O
CA   + H(+).
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of the cyanogenic glucosides (R)-
CC       prunasin and (R)-amygdalin.
CC   -!- It catalyzes three different activities - isomerization of the (E)
CC       isomer to the (Z) isomer, dehydration, and C-hydroxylation.
DR   A0A068Q609, C7124_PRUMU;
