CA   a 12-hydroxyjasmonyl-L-alpha-amino acid + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein
CA   reductase] + H2O + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in plants, acts on jasmonoyl-L-amino conjugates,
