CA   reductase] + 2 O2 = a 12-hydroxy-12-oxojasmonyl-L-alpha-amino acid +
CA   2 oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] + 3 H2O + 3 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in plants, acts on jasmonoyl-L-amino conjugates
CC       that have been hydroxylated at the C-12 position of the jasmonic acid
