CC       animals and many bacteria, it is catalyzed by either membrane-bound
CC       EC 1.1.99.1 or soluble EC 1.1.3.17.
CC   -!- The enzyme involved in the second step, EC 1.2.1.8, appears to be the
CC       same in plants, animals and bacteria.
