AN   CYP128.
CA   beta-dihydromenaquinone-9 + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + O2 + 2 H(+)
CA   = omega-hydroxy-beta-dihydromenaquinone-9 + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-
CA   [ferredoxin] + H2O.
