CC       pathogens.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in degradation of the host's cholesterol.
CC   -!- It catalyzes the hydroxylation of the C-26 carbon, followed by
CC       oxidation of the alcohol to the carboxylic acid via the aldehyde
