CC       cholesterol.
CC   -!- The products are exclusively in the (25S) conformation.
CC   -!- The enzyme also accepts cholesterol as a substrate. cf.
CC       EC 1.14.15.28.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.13.141.
