DE   N,N-dimethyl phenylurea N-demethylase.
CA   a 1,1-dimethyl-3-phenylurea + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + O2 +
CA   2 H(+) = a 1-methyl-3-phenylurea + formaldehyde + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-
CA   [ferredoxin] + H2O.
