CA   a (4E,8E)-4-sphinga-4,8-dienine ceramide + 2 Fe(II)-[cytochrome b5] +
CA   O2 + 2 H(+) = an N-acyl-(4E,8E,10E)-sphingatrienine + 2 Fe(III)-
