CA   a 1-[(9Z,12Z)-octadecdienoyl]-2-acyl-glycerolipid + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-
CA   [ferredoxin] + O2 + 2 H(+) = a 1-[(6Z,9Z,12Z)-octadectrienoyl]-2-acyl-
CA   glycerolipid + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + 2 H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from cyanobacteria, introduces a cis double
CC       bond at carbon 6 of linoleoyl groups (18:2) attached to the sn-1
CC       position of glycerolipids.
CC   -!- The enzyme is a front-end desaturase, introducing the new double bond
