CA   dibromobenzene-1,2-diol + CO2 + 2 NADP(+) + 4 H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme, described from epiphytic marine bacteria of the genera
CC       Pseudoalteromonas and Marinomonas, is an unusual single-component
CC       FAD-dependent halogenase that contains a distinct NAD(P)H binding
