CA   + 2 O2 = (4,5-dichloro-1H-pyrrole-2-carbonyl)-[peptidyl-carrier protein]
CA   + 2 FAD + 4 H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Pseudomonas protegens
