CA   (2E)-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-2-isocyanoprop-2-enoate + succinate + CO2 + H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme is a member of the Fe(2+), 2-oxoglutarate-dependent
CC       oxygenases and requires Fe(2+).
CC   -!- It has been characterized from bacteria that form the isonitrile-
CC       functionalized compound paerucumarin. cf. EC 1.14.20.10.
