ID   1.14.20.10
DE   tyrosine isonitrile desaturase/decarboxylase.
CA   (2S)-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-2-isocyanopropanoate + 2-oxoglutarate + O2 +
CA   H(+) = 4-[(E)-2-isocyanoethenyl]phenol + succinate + 2 CO2 + H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Xenorhabdus nematophila,
CC       is involved in rhabduscin biosynthesis.
CC   -!- The enzyme is a member of the Fe(2+), 2-oxoglutarate-dependent
CC       oxygenases.
CC   -!- It is similar to EC 1.14.20.9; however, the latter does not catalyze
CC       a decarboxylation of the substrate.
DR   D3V9Q5, PVCB_XENNA ;
