ID   1.14.20.12
DE   3-[(E)-2-isocyanoethenyl]-1H-indole synthase.
CA   (2S)-3-(1H-indol-3-yl)-2-isocyanopropanoate + 2-oxoglutarate + O2 + H(+)
CA   = 3-[(E)-2-isocyanovinyl]indole + succinate + 2 CO2 + H2O.
CC   -!- The enzyme has been characterized from an unidentified soil
CC       bacterium.
CC   -!- It catalyzes an Fe(2+), 2-oxoglutarate-dependent monooxygenation at
CC       C-3, which is followed by decarboxylation and dehydration, resulting
CC       in the generation of a trans C-C double bond. cf. EC 1.14.20.11.
//
