DE   diapolycopene oxygenase.
CA   all-trans-4,4'-diapolycopene + 4 AH2 + 4 O2 = all-trans-
CA   4,4'-diapolycopene-4,4'-dial + 4 A + 6 H2O.
CC   -!- Little activity with neurosporene or lycopene.
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of C30 carotenoids such as
CC       staphyloxanthin.
