ID   1.17.7.2
DE   7-hydroxymethyl chlorophyll a reductase.
CA   chlorophyll a + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + H2O = 7(1)-
CA   hydroxychlorophyll a + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- This enzyme, which is present in plant chloroplasts, carries out the
CC       second step in the conversion of chlorophyll b to chlorophyll a (cf.
CC       EC 1.1.1.294).
DR   Q8GS60, HCAR_ARATH ;  Q7XTG7, HCAR_ORYSJ ;
