ID   1.17.99.6
DE   epoxyqueuosine reductase.
AN   oQ reductase.
CA   epoxyqueuosine(34) in tRNA + AH2 = queuosine(34) in tRNA + A + H2O.
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes the last step in the bacterial biosynthetic
CC       pathway to queuosine, the modified guanosine base in the wobble
CC       position in tRNAs specific for Tyr, His, Asp or Asn.
CC   -!- Two types of enzymes are known to catalyze this activity.
