ID   1.18.1.3
DE   ferredoxin--NAD(+) reductase.
CA   (1) 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + NAD(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [2Fe-
CA   2S]-[ferredoxin] + NADH.
CA   (2) reduced 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] + NAD(+) + H(+) = oxidized 2[4Fe-4S]-
CA   [ferredoxin] + NADH.
CC   -!- The reaction is written for a [2Fe-2S] ferredoxin, which is
CC       characteristic of some mono- and dioxygenase systems.
CC   -!- Some anaerobic bacteria have a 2[4Fe-4S] ferredoxin, which transfers
CC       two electrons.
