ID   1.18.1.4
DE   rubredoxin--NAD(P)(+) reductase.
AN   dinucleotide phosphate reductase.
AN   NAD(P)H-rubredoxin oxidoreductase.
AN   NAD(P)-rubredoxin oxidoreductase.
AN   rubredoxin-nicotinamide adenine.
AN   rubredoxin-nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (phosphate) reductase.
CA   (1) 2 reduced [rubredoxin] + NADP(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [rubredoxin] +
CA   NADPH.
CA   (2) 2 reduced [rubredoxin] + NAD(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [rubredoxin] +
CA   NADH.
CC   -!- The enzyme reduces a number of electron carriers, including benzyl
CC       viologen, menadione and 2,6-dichloroindophenol, but rubredoxin is the
CC       most efficient.
CC   -!- Ferredoxin is not utilized.
DR   Q8U1K9, NROR_PYRFU ;
