ID   1.18.1.5
DE   putidaredoxin--NAD(+) reductase.
AN   putidaredoxin reductase.
CA   2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[putidaredoxin] + NAD(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-
CA   [putidaredoxin] + NADH.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Pseudomonas putida reduces putidaredoxin.
CC   -!- It contains a [2Fe-2S] cluster.
CC   -!- Involved in the camphor monooxygenase system (see EC 1.14.15.1).
DR   P16640, CAMA_PSEPU ;
//
