DE   adrenodoxin-NADP(+) reductase.
AN   adrenodoxin reductase.
AN   nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate-adrenodoxin reductase.
CA   2 reduced [adrenodoxin] + NADP(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [adrenodoxin] +
