AN   NADH-ferredoxin(NAP) reductase.
CA   (1) 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + NADP(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [2Fe-
CA   2S]-[ferredoxin] + NADPH.
CA   (2) 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + NAD(+) + H(+) = 2 oxidized [2Fe-
CA   2S]-[ferredoxin] + NADH.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the aerobic bacterium Ralstonia sp. U2 donates
