ID   1.21.3.10
DE   hercynylcysteine S-oxide synthase.
CA   hercynine + L-cysteine + O2 = S-(hercyn-2-yl)-L-cysteine S-oxide + H2O.
CC   -!- Requires Fe(2+) for activity.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in fungal species, is part of a fusion protein that
CC       also has the the activity of EC 2.1.1.44.
CC   -!- It is part of the biosynthesis pathway of ergothioneine.
CC   -!- The enzyme can also use L-selenocysteine to produce
CC       hercynylselenocysteine, which can be converted to selenoneine.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.99.51.
