ID   1.21.98.3
DE   anaerobic magnesium-protoporphyrin IX monomethyl ester cyclase.
AN   MPE cyclase.
CA   Mg-protoporphyrin IX 13-monomethyl ester + 3 S-adenosyl-L-methionine +
CA   H2O = 3,8-divinyl protochlorophyllide a + 3 5'-deoxyadenosine +
