CC   -!- This radical AdoMet enzyme participates in the biosynthesis of
CC       chlorophyllide a in anaerobic bacteria, catalyzing the formation of
CC       an isocyclic ring.
CC   -!- The same transformation is achieved in aerobic organisms by the
CC       oxygen-dependent EC 1.14.13.81.
CC   -!- Some facultative phototrophic bacteria, such as Rubrivivax
CC       gelatinosus, possess both enzymes.
DR   Q9RFD3, BCHE_CERS4 ;  P26168, BCHE_RHOCB ;  Q7X2C7, BCHE_RUBGE ;
DR   Q55373, BCHE_SYNY3 ;
