CA   tetrahydroxybenzene + 1,3,5-trihydroxybenzene.
CC   -!- 1,2,3,5-Tetrahydroxybenzene acts as a cosubstrate for the conversion
CC       of pyrogallol into phloroglucinol, and for a number of similar
CC       isomerizations.
