CA   glycyl-[formate C-acetyltransferase] + reduced [flavodoxin] + S-adenosyl-
CA   L-methionine = glycin-2-yl radical-[formate C-acetyltransferase] +
CA   semiquinone [flavodoxin] + 5'-deoxyadenosine + L-methionine + H(+).
CC   -!- A single glycine residue in EC 2.3.1.54 is oxidized to the
CC       corresponding radical by transfer of H from its CH2 to AdoMet with
CC       concomitant cleavage of the latter.
