ID   2.1.1.76
DE   quercetin 3-O-methyltransferase.
AN   flavonol 3-O-methyltransferase.
CA   quercetin + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 3',4',5,7-tetrahydroxy-3-
CA   methoxyflavone + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + H(+).
CC   -!- Specific for quercetin.
CC   -!- Related enzymes bring about the 3-O-methylation of other flavonols,
CC       such as galangin and kaempferol.
DR   M9Z1G5, MOMT3_SOLHA;  A0A3Q7HYF0, MOMT3_SOLLC;
