CC   -!- Catalyzes the last step in the biosynthesis of rebeccamycin,
CC       an indolocarbazole alkaloid produced by the bacterium Lechevalieria
CC       aerocolonigenes.
CC   -!- The enzyme is able to use a wide variety substrates, tolerating
CC       variation on the imide heterocycle, deoxygenation of the sugar
CC       moiety, and even indolocarbazole glycoside anomers.
