CC       which binds to the 50S ribosomal subunit to inhibit protein
CC       synthesis.
CC   -!- To protect itself from the antibiotic, Streptomyces viridochromogenes
CC       utilizes two methyltransferases, 23S rRNA (guanine(2535)-N(1))-
CC       methyltransferase and EC 2.1.1.208 whose actions confer avilamycin
CC       resistance to the RNA.
