ID   2.1.1.214
DE   tRNA (guanine(10)-N(2))-methyltransferase.
CA   guanosine(10) in tRNA + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = N(2)-
CA   methylguanosine(10) in tRNA + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + H(+).
CC   -!- In contrast to the archaeal enzyme EC 2.1.1.213, tRNA (guanine(10)-
CC       N(2))-methyltransferase from yeast does not catalyze the methylation
CC       from N(2)-methylguanine(10) to N(2)-dimethylguanine(10) in tRNA.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.1.1.32.
DR   Q05B63, TRM11_BOVIN;  Q6YJI5, TRM11_CHICK;  Q54QA6, TRM11_DICDI;
DR   Q7Z4G4, TRM11_HUMAN;  Q9CWH5, TRM11_MOUSE;  Q5R962, TRM11_PONAB;
DR   Q7TNK6, TRM11_RAT  ;  O94636, TRM11_SCHPO;  Q6NS23, TRM11_XENLA;
DR   Q12463, TRM11_YEAST;
