ID   2.1.1.217
DE   tRNA (adenine(22)-N(1))-methyltransferase.
CA   adenosine(22) in tRNA + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = N(1)-
CA   methyladenosine(22) in tRNA + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme specifically methylates adenine(22) in tRNA.
