ID   2.1.1.222
DE   2-polyprenyl-6-hydroxyphenol methylase.
AN   2-octaprenyl-6-hydroxyphenol methylase.
CA   a 3-(all-trans-polyprenyl)benzene-1,2-diol + S-adenosyl-L-methionine =
CA   a 2-methoxy-6-(all-trans-polyprenyl)phenol + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine +
CA   H(+).
CC   -!- UbiG catalyzes both methylation steps in ubiquinone biosynthesis in
CC       Escherichia coli.
CC   -!- The second methylation is classified as EC 2.1.1.64.
CC   -!- In eukaryotes Coq3 catalyzes the two methylation steps in ubiquinone
CC       biosynthesis.
CC   -!- However, while the second methylation is common to both enzymes,
CC       the first methylation by Coq3 occurs at a different position within
CC       the pathway, and thus involves a different substrate and is
CC       classified as EC 2.1.1.114.
CC   -!- The substrate of the eukaryotic enzyme (3,4-dihydroxy-5-all-trans-
CC       polyprenylbenzoate) differs by an additional carboxylate moiety.
