ID   2.1.1.229
DE   tRNA (carboxymethyluridine(34)-5-O)-methyltransferase.
AN   tRNA methyltransferase 9.
CA   5-(carboxymethyl)uridine(34) in tRNA + S-adenosyl-L-methionine =
CA   5-(2-methoxy-2-oxoethyl)uridine(34) in tRNA + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes the post-translational modification of uridine
CC       residues at the wobble position 34 of the anticodon loop of tRNA.
DR   A1A4L5, ALKB8_BOVIN;  Q96BT7, ALKB8_HUMAN;  Q95K79, ALKB8_MACFA;
DR   Q80Y20, ALKB8_MOUSE;  Q07G10, ALKB8_XENTR;  Q94A09, TRM9_ARATH ;
DR   D4GVK8, TRM9_HALVD ;  Q10224, TRM9_SCHPO ;  P49957, TRM9_YEAST ;
