ID   2.1.1.234
DE   dTDP-3-amino-3,4,6-trideoxy-alpha-D-glucopyranose
DE   N,N-dimethyltransferase.
CA   dTDP-3-amino-3,4,6-trideoxy-alpha-D-glucose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine =
CA   dTDP-alpha-D-desosamine + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of desosamine,
CC       a 3-(dimethylamino)-3,4,6-trideoxyhexose found in certain macrolide
CC       antibiotics such as erthyromycin, azithromycin, and clarithromycin.
DR   Q9ZGH6, DESVI_STRVZ;
//
ID   2.1.1.235
DE   dTDP-3-amino-3,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-glucopyranose N,N-dimethyltransferase.
CA   dTDP-3-amino-3,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-glucose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine =
CA   dTDP-alpha-D-mycaminose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of mycaminose,
CC       an essential structural component of the macrolide antibiotic
CC       tylosin, which is produced by the bacterium Streptomyces fradiae.
DR   P95748, TYLM1_STRFR;
//
ID   2.1.1.236
DE   dTDP-3-amino-3,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-galactopyranose N,N-dimethyltransferase.
CA   dTDP-3-amino-3,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-galactopyranose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-
CA   methionine = dTDP-D-ravidosamine + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the synthesis of dTDP-D-ravidosamine,
CC       the amino sugar moiety of the antibiotic ravidomycin V, which is
CC       produced by the bacterium Streptomyces ravidus.
//
ID   2.1.1.237
DE   mycinamicin III 3''-O-methyltransferase.
CA   mycinamicin III + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = mycinamicin IV + S-adenosyl-
CA   L-homocysteine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of mycinamicin macrolide
CC       antibiotics.
DR   Q49492, MYCF_MICGR ;
