CA   farnesoate + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.
CA   (2) juvenile hormone III carboxylate + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = juvenile
CA   hormone III + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in insects, is involved in the synthesis of
