ID   2.1.1.398
DE   isoflavone 3'-O-methyltransferase.
CA   a 3'-hydroxyisoflavone + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = a 3'-methoxyisoflavone
CA   + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a step in the biosynthesis of
