CC       leguminosa.
CC   -!- The highest activity has been found for 3'-hydroxydaidzein. The
CC       enzyme has low activity on the 3'-hydroxyflavones luteolin and
CC       quercetin.
CC   -!- 3'-hydroxypuerarin is not a substrate.
//
