ID   2.1.2.4
DE   glycine formimidoyltransferase.
AN   FIG formiminotransferase.
AN   formiminoglycine formiminotransferase.
AN   glycine formiminotransferase.
CA   5-formimidoyltetrahydrofolate + glycine = N-formimidoylglycine + (6S)-
CA   5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate.
//
ID   2.1.2.5
DE   glutamate formimidoyltransferase.
AN   formiminoglutamic acid transferase.
AN   formiminoglutamic formiminotransferase.
AN   glutamate formiminotransferase.
AN   glutamate formyltransferase.
CA   5-formimidoyltetrahydrofolate + L-glutamate = N-formimidoyl-L-glutamate +
CA   (6S)-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate.
CC   -!- The enzymes also catalyzes formyl transfer from
CC       5-formyltetrahydrofolate to L-glutamate.
CC   -!- In eukaryotes, it occurs as a bifunctional enzyme that also has
CC       formimidoyltetrahydrofolate cyclodeaminase (EC 4.3.1.4) activity.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.1.2.6.
