ID   2.3.1.12
DE   dihydrolipoyllysine-residue acetyltransferase.
AN   acetyl-CoA:dihydrolipoamide S-acetyltransferase.
AN   dihydrolipoamide S-acetyltransferase.
AN   dihydrolipoate acetyltransferase.
AN   dihydrolipoic transacetylase.
AN   dihydrolipoyl acetyltransferase.
AN   lipoate acetyltransferase.
AN   lipoate transacetylase.
AN   lipoic acetyltransferase.
AN   lipoic acid acetyltransferase.
AN   lipoic transacetylase.
AN   lipoylacetyltransferase.
AN   thioltransacetylase A.
