CA   acetyldihydrolipoyl]-L-lysyl-[protein] + CoA.
CC   -!- A multimer (24-mer or 60-mer, depending on the source) of this enzyme
CC       forms the core of the pyruvate dehydrogenase multienzyme complex,
CC       and binds tightly both EC 1.2.4.1 and EC 1.8.1.4.
CC   -!- The lipoyl group of this enzyme is reductively acetylated by
CC       EC 1.2.4.1, and the only observed direction catalyzed by EC 2.3.1.12
CC       is that where the acetyl group is passed to coenzyme A.
