CA   a 2-deoxystreptamine antibiotic + acetyl-CoA = an N(3)-acetyl-2-
CA   deoxystreptamine antibiotic + CoA + H(+).
CC   -!- A wide range of antibiotics containing the 2-deoxystreptamine ring
