ID   2.3.1.85
DE   fatty-acid synthase system.
AN   fatty-acid synthase.
CA   acetyl-CoA + n malonyl-CoA + 2n NADPH + 2n H(+) = a long-chain fatty acid
CA   + (n+1) CoA + n CO2 + 2n NADP(+).
CC   -!- The animal enzyme is a multifunctional protein catalyzing the
CC       reactions of EC 2.3.1.38, EC 2.3.1.39, EC 2.3.1.41, EC 1.1.1.100,
CC       EC 4.2.1.59, EC 1.3.1.39 and EC 3.1.2.14. cf. EC 2.3.1.86.
