AN   stilbene synthase.
CA   4-coumaroyl-CoA + 3 malonyl-CoA + 3 H(+) = trans-resveratrol + 4 CO2 +
CA   4 CoA.
CC   -!- Not identical with EC 2.3.1.74 or EC 2.3.1.146.
