AN   ACS.
CA   Co(I)-[corrinoid Fe-S protein] + acetyl-CoA + H(+) = methyl-Co(III)-
CA   [corrinoid Fe-S protein] + CO + CoA.
CC   -!- Involved, together with EC 1.2.7.4 in the synthesis of acetyl-CoA
CC       from CO2 and H2.
