ID   2.3.1.170
DE   6'-deoxychalcone synthase.
CA   4-coumaroyl-CoA + 3 malonyl-CoA + NADPH + 4 H(+) = isoliquiritigenin +
CA   3 CO2 + NADP(+) + 4 CoA + H2O.
CC   -!- Isoliquiritigenin is the precursor of liquiritigenin,
CC       a 5-deoxyflavanone.
DR   P26690, 6DCS_SOYBN ;
