ID   2.3.1.171
DE   anthocyanin 6''-O-malonyltransferase.
AN   3MaT.
CA   an anthocyanidin 3-O-beta-D-glucoside + malonyl-CoA = an anthocyanidin
CA   3-O-(6-O-malonyl-beta-D-glucoside) + CoA.
CC   -!- Acts on pelargonidin 3-O-glucoside in dahlia (Dahlia variabilis),
CC       delphinidin 3-O-glucoside, and on cyanidin 3-O-glucoside in
CC       transgenic petunia (Petunia hybrida).
DR   Q8GSN8, 3MAT_DAHPI ;
//
ID   2.3.1.172
DE   anthocyanin 5-O-glucoside 6'''-O-malonyltransferase.
AN   Ss5MaT1.
CA   pelargonidin 3-O-(6-O-[(E)-caffeoyl]-beta-D-glucoside) 5-O-beta-D-
CA   glucoside + malonyl-CoA = 4'''-demalonylsalvianin + CoA.
CC   -!- Specific for the penultimate step in salvianin biosynthesis.
CC   -!- The enzyme also catalyzes the malonylation of shisonin to
CC       malonylshisonin [cyanidin 3-O-(6''-O-p-coumaryl-beta-D-glucoside)-5-
CC       (6'''-O-malonyl-beta-D-glucoside)].
CC   -!- The compounds 4'''-demalonylsalvianin, salvianin, pelargonidin 3,5-
CC       diglucoside and delphinidin 3,5-diglucoside cannot act as substrates.
DR   Q8W1W9, 5MAT1_SALSN;
//
ID   2.3.1.173
DE   flavonol-3-O-triglucoside O-coumaroyltransferase.
CA   a flavonol 3-O-beta-D-glucosyl-(1->2)-beta-D-glucosyl-(1->2)-beta-D-
CA   glucoside + 4-coumaroyl-CoA = a flavonol 3-O-[6-(4-coumaroyl)-beta-D-
CA   glucosyl-(1->2)-beta-D-glucosyl-(1->2)-beta-D-glucoside] + CoA.
CC   -!- Acylates kaempferol 3-O-triglucoside on the terminal glucosyl unit,
CC       almost certainly at C-6.
