ID   2.3.1.176
DE   propanoyl-CoA C-acyltransferase.
AN   3-oxopristanoyl-CoA hydrolase.
AN   3-oxopristanoyl-CoA thiolase.
AN   peroxisomal thiolase 2.
AN   propionyl-CoA C(2)-trimethyltridecanoyltransferase.
AN   PTE-2.
AN   SCPchi.
AN   SCP-X.
AN   sterol carrier protein-chi.
AN   sterol carrier protein-X.
CA   choloyl-CoA + propanoyl-CoA = 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-24-oxo-
CA   5beta-cholestan-26-oyl-CoA + CoA.
CC   -!- Also acts on dihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA and other branched
CC       chain acyl-CoA derivatives.
CC   -!- Catalyzes the penultimate step in the formation of bile acids.
CC   -!- The bile acid moiety is transferred from the acyl-CoA thioester (RCO-
