ID   2.3.1.177
DE   3,5-dihydroxybiphenyl synthase.
AN   biphenyl synthase.
AN   BIS.
CA   benzoyl-CoA + 3 malonyl-CoA + 3 H(+) = biphenyl-3,5-diol + 4 CO2 + 4 CoA.
CC   -!- A polyketide synthase that is involved in the production of the
CC       phytoalexin aucuparin.
CC   -!- 2-hydroxybenzoyl-CoA can also act as substrate but it leads to the
CC       derailment product 4-hydroxycoumarin (cf. EC 2.3.1.208).
CC   -!- This enzyme uses the same starter substrate as EC 2.3.1.151.
DR   Q27Z07, BIPS1_SORAU;
