ID   2.3.1.178
DE   diaminobutyrate acetyltransferase.
AN   2,4-diaminobutanoate acetyltransferase.
AN   DABA acetyltransferase.
AN   DAB acetyltransferase.
AN   DABAcT.
AN   diaminobutyric acid acetyltransferase.
AN   L-2,4-diaminobutanoate acetyltransferase.
AN   L-2,4-diaminobutyrate acetyltransferase.
CA   L-2,4-diaminobutanoate + acetyl-CoA = (2S)-4-acetamido-2-aminobutanoate +
CA   CoA + H(+).
CC   -!- Ornithine, lysine, aspartate, and alpha-, beta- and gamma-
CC       aminobutanoate cannot act as substrates.
