ID   2.3.1.194
DE   acetoacetyl-CoA synthase.
AN   NphT7.
CA   malonyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA + H(+) = acetoacetyl-CoA + CO2 + CoA.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the soil bacterium Streptomyces sp. CL190 produces
CC       acetoacetyl-CoA to be used for mevalonate production via the
CC       mevalonate pathway.
