ID   2.3.1.198
DE   glycerol-3-phosphate 2-O-acyltransferase.
AN   sn-2-glycerol-3-phosphate O-acyltransferase.
CA   sn-glycerol 3-phosphate + an acyl-CoA = a 2-acyl-sn-glycerol 3-phosphate
CA   + CoA.
CC   -!- A membrane-associated enzyme required for suberin or cutin synthesis
CC       in plants.
CC   -!- Active with a wide range of acyl-CoA substrates (C16:0-C24:0).
CC   -!- The enzyme from some sources has much higher activity with omega-
CC       oxidized acyl-CoAs.
CC   -!- Some enzymes are bifunctional and have an additional phosphatase
CC       activity producing sn-2-monoacylglycerols.
DR   Q9LMM0, GPAT4_ARATH;  O80437, GPAT6_ARATH;
