DR   A5VMA5, PDUL_LIMRD ;  Q8Y7T9, PDUL_LISMO ;  D5SXM0, PDUL_PLAL2 ;
DR   D5DKA5, PDUL_PRIM3 ;  D5AKU6, PDUL_RHOCB ;  Q21A54, PDUL_RHOPB ;
DR   A9MLP6, PDUL_SALAR ;  Q9XDN5, PDUL_SALTY ;  D1AFM9, PDUL_SEBTE ;
DR   A4Y1V6, PDUL_SHEPC ;  Q9WYK8, PDUL_THEMA ;  Q8ZND6, PTA_SALTY  ;
//
ID   2.3.1.223
DE   3-oxo-5,6-didehydrosuberyl-CoA thiolase.
CA   2,3-didehydroadipoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA = 3-oxo-5,6-didehydrosuberyl-CoA +
CA   CoA.
CC   -!- The enzyme acts in the opposite direction.
CC   -!- The enzymes from the bacteria Escherichia coli and Pseudomonas sp. Y2
CC       also have the activity of EC 2.3.1.174.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.3.1.n11.
DR   P0C7L2, PAAJ_ECOLI ;
//
ID   2.3.1.224
DE   acetyl-CoA-benzylalcohol acetyltransferase.
CA   (1) benzyl alcohol + acetyl-CoA = benzyl acetate + CoA.
CA   (2) (E)-cinnamyl alcohol + acetyl-CoA = (E)-cinnamyl acetate + CoA.
CC   -!- The enzyme is found in flowers like Clarkia breweri, where it is
CC       important for floral scent production.
CC   -!- Unlike EC 2.3.1.84 this enzyme is active with alcohols that contain a
CC       benzyl ring.
DR   O64988, BEATH_CLABR;  Q9SPU3, BEATL_CLABR;  Q6E593, BEBT1_PETHY;
DR   A1XWY7, CFAT_PETHY ;
//
ID   2.3.1.225
DE   protein S-acyltransferase.
AN   DHHC palmitoyl transferase.
AN   G-protein palmitoyltransferase.
AN   S-protein acyltransferase.
CA   L-cysteinyl-[protein] + hexadecanoyl-CoA = S-hexadecanoyl-L-cysteinyl-
CA   [protein] + CoA.
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes the post-translational protein palmitoylation
CC       that plays a role in protein-membrane interactions, protein
CC       trafficking, and enzyme activity.
CC   -!- Palmitoylation increases the hydrophobicity of proteins or protein
CC       domains and contributes to their membrane association.
