CC       specific for 2,3-diamino-2,3-dideoxy-D-glucopyranose, while others,
CC       such as the enzyme from Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans, are also able
CC       to accept UDP-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosamine (cf. EC 2.3.1.129).
CC   -!- The enzymes from different organisms also differ in their specificity
