ID   2.3.2.25
DE   N-terminal E2 ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme.
AN   N-terminal ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme E2.
CA   S-ubiquitinyl-[E1 ubiquitin-activating enzyme]-L-cysteine + [acceptor
CA   protein]-N-terminal-amino acid = [E1 ubiquitin-activating enzyme]-L-
CA   cysteine + N-terminal-ubiquitinyl-[acceptor protein].
CC   -!- The enzyme ubiquitinylates the N-terminus of the acceptor protein.
CC   -!- It is not reactive toward free lysine.
