ID   2.3.2.29
DE   aspartate/glutamate leucyltransferase.
CA   (1) N-terminal L-glutamyl-[protein] + L-leucyl-tRNA(Leu) = N-terminal
CA   L-leucyl-L-glutamyl-[protein] + tRNA(Leu) + H(+).
CA   (2) N-terminal L-aspartyl-[protein] + L-leucyl-tRNA(Leu) = N-terminal
CA   L-leucyl-L-aspartyl-[protein] + tRNA(Leu) + H(+).
