ID   2.3.2.33
DE   RCR-type E3 ubiquitin transferase.
AN   MYCBP2.
AN   PHR1.
CA   [E2 ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme]-S-ubiquitinyl-L-cysteine + [acceptor
CA   protein]-L-threonine = [E2 ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme]-L-cysteine +
CA   [acceptor protein]-3-O-ubiquitinyl-L-threonine.
CC   -!- RCR-type E3 ubiquitin transferases is a class of RING-type E3
CC       ubiquitin transferase (see EC 2.3.2.27) that mediates ubiquitination
CC       of acceptor proteins via an internal cysteine residue.
CC   -!- The RING1 domain binds an EC 2.3.2.23 and transfers the ubiquitin
CC       that is bound to it to an internal cysteine residue on a mediator
CC       loop of the RCR-type ligase.
CC   -!- The ubiquitin may be transferred to a second internal cysteine before
CC       the transfer of the ubiquitin from the RCR-type ligase to the
CC       substrate.
