ID   2.3.2.35
DE   capsaicin synthase.
CA   vanillylamine + (6E)-8-methylnon-6-enoyl-CoA = capsaicin + CoA + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, found only in plants that belong to the Capsicum genus,
CC       catalyzes the last step in the biosynthesis of capsaicinoids.
