CC       glucan chain.
CC   -!- They are classified based on the linkage by which they attach the
CC       transferred residue.
CC   -!- In some cases, in which the enzyme forms more than one linkage type,
CC       classification relies on the relative proportion of the linkages that
CC       are generated.
CC   -!- This enzyme extends the glucan chain by an alpha(1->6) linkage.
