ID   2.4.1.170
DE   isoflavone 7-O-glucosyltransferase.
CA   a 7-hydroxyisoflavone + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = a 7-hydroxyisoflavone 7-O-
CA   beta-D-glucoside + UDP + H(+).
CC   -!- The 4'-methoxy isoflavones biochanin A and formononetin and, more
CC       slowly, the 4'-hydroxy isoflavones genistein and daidzein, can act as
CC       acceptors.
CC   -!- The enzyme does not act on isoflavanones, flavones, flavanones,
CC       flavanols or coumarins.
DR   A0A193AUF6, GGT23_PUNGR;  A0A193AU77, GGT24_PUNGR;  A6BM07, I7GT1_SOYBN;
DR   A0A067YBQ3, UGT13_PUEML;  A0A067YB04, UGT1_PUEML ;
