ID   2.4.1.171
DE   methyl-ONN-azoxymethanol beta-D-glucosyltransferase.
AN   cycasin synthase.
CA   methylazoxymethanol + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = cycasin + UDP + H(+).
CC   -!- Brings about the biosynthesis of the toxic substance cycasin in the
CC       leaves of Japanese cycad, Cycas revoluta.
//
ID   2.4.1.172
DE   salicyl-alcohol beta-D-glucosyltransferase.
CA   salicyl alcohol + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = salicin + UDP + H(+).
