ID   2.4.1.177
DE   cinnamate beta-D-glucosyltransferase.
CA   (E)-cinnamate + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = 1-O-(trans-cinnamoyl)-beta-D-
CA   glucose + UDP.
CC   -!- 4-coumarate, 2-coumarate, benzoate, feruloate and caffeate can also
