DE   alpha,alpha-trehalose synthase.
AN   trehalose synthase.
AN   trehalose synthetase.
CA   an NDP-alpha-D-glucose + D-glucose = alpha,alpha-trehalose +
CA   a ribonucleoside 5'-diphosphate + H(+).
