CA   alpha-D-glucosidic bond.
CC   -!- Specific for (1->6)-alpha-D-glucans (dextrans) and, unlike
CC       cyclomaltodextrin glucanotransferase (EC 2.4.1.19), without activity
CC       toward (1->4)-alpha-D-glucans, such as amylose.
