ID   2.4.2.2
DE   pyrimidine-nucleoside phosphorylase.
AN   Py-NPase.
CA   (1) uridine + phosphate = alpha-D-ribose 1-phosphate + uracil.
CA   (2) cytidine + phosphate = cytosine + alpha-D-ribose 1-phosphate.
CA   (3) 2'-deoxyuridine + phosphate = 2-deoxy-alpha-D-ribose 1-phosphate +
CA   uracil.
CA   (4) thymidine + phosphate = 2-deoxy-alpha-D-ribose 1-phosphate + thymine.
CC   -!- Unlike EC 2.4.2.3 and EC 2.4.2.4, this enzyme can accept both the
CC       ribonucleoside uridine and the 2'-deoxyribonucleosides
CC       2'-deoxyuridine and thymidine.
CC   -!- The reaction is reversible, and the enzyme does not distinguish
CC       between alpha-D-ribose 1-phosphate and 2-deoxy-alpha-D-ribose
CC       1-phosphate in the synthetic direction.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.4.2.23.
