ID   2.4.99.23
DE   lipopolysaccharide heptosyltransferase I.
AN   heptosyltransferase I.
CA   an alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A + ADP-L-glycero-beta-D-
CA   manno-heptose = an L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->5)-[alpha-Kdo-(2->4)]-alpha-
CA   Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a glycosylation step in the biosynthesis of the
CC       inner core oligosaccharide of the lipopolysaccharide (endotoxin) of
CC       many Gram-negative bacteria.
DR   O87333, WAAC_CAMCO ;  P0DX54, WAAC_ECOK8 ;  P24173, WAAC_ECOLI ;
DR   Q9HUF5, WAAC_PSEAE ;  P26469, WAAC_SALTY ;
