ID   2.4.99.24
DE   lipopolysaccharide heptosyltransferase II.
AN   heptosyltransferase II.
CA   an L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->5)-[alpha-Kdo-(2->4)]-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A +
CA   ADP-L-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose = an L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->3)-L-alpha-D-
CA   Hep-(1->5)-[alpha-Kdo-(2->4)]-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a glycosylation step in the biosynthesis of the
CC       inner core oligosaccharide of the lipopolysaccharide (endotoxin) of
CC       some Gram-negative bacteria.
DR   P0DX62, WAAF_CAMJ8 ;  Q0P9A8, WAAF_CAMJE ;  P37692, WAAF_ECOLI ;
