ID   2.4.99.25
DE   lipopolysaccharide heptosyltransferase III.
CA   an L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->3)-4-O-phospho-L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->5)-[alpha-
CA   Kdo-(2->4)]-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A + ADP-L-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose
CA   = an L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->7)-L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->3)-4-O-phospho-L-alpha-D-Hep-
CA   (1->5)-[alpha-Kdo-(2->4)]-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a glycosylation step in the biosynthesis of the
CC       inner core oligosaccharide of the lipopolysaccharide (endotoxin) of
CC       some Gram-negative bacteria.
DR   P25742, WAAQ_ECOLI ;  Q9R9D5, WAAQ_ECOLX ;
