DE   spermidine synthase.
AN   aminopropyltransferase.
AN   putrescine aminopropyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl 3-(methylsulfanyl)propylamine + putrescine = S-methyl-
CA   5'-thioadenosine + spermidine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzymes from the plant Glycine max and from mammalia are highly
