DE   heptaprenyl diphosphate synthase.
AN   all-trans-heptaprenyl-diphosphate synthase.
AN   HepPP synthase.
AN   heptaprenyl pyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   trans-hexaprenyltranstransferase.
CA   4 isopentenyl diphosphate + (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate = all-trans-
CA   heptaprenyl diphosphate + 4 diphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes the condensation reactions resulting in the
CC       formation of all-trans-heptaprenyl diphosphate, the isoprenoid side
CC       chain of ubiquinone-7 and menaquinone-7.
