CA   5'-thioadenosine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Nocardia uniformis,
CC       is involved in the biosynthesis of the beta-lactam antibiotic
CC       nocardicin A.
CC   -!- The enzyme can act on nocardicin E, F, and G, producing isonocardicin
CC       A, B, and C, respectively.
CC   -!- However, the in vivo substrate is believed to be nocardicin G.
