ID   2.5.1.60
DE   protein geranylgeranyltransferase type II.
AN   GGTaseII.
AN   Rab geranylgeranyltransferase.
AN   RabGGTase.
AN   type II protein geranyl-geranyltransferase.
CA   geranylgeranyl diphosphate + L-cysteinyl-[protein] = S-geranylgeranyl-L-
CA   cysteinyl-[protein] + diphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme, along with EC 2.5.1.58 and EC 2.5.1.59, constitutes the
CC       protein prenyltransferase family of enzymes.
CC   -!- Attaches geranylgeranyl groups to two C-terminal cysteines in Ras-
CC       related GTPases of a single family, the Rab family (Ypt/Sec4 in lower
CC       eukaryotes) that terminate in XXCC, XCXC and CCXX motifs.
CC   -!- Reaction is entirely dependent on the Rab substrate being bound to
CC       Rab escort protein (REP).
CC   -!- Post-translational modification with the geranylgeranyl moiety is
CC       essential for Rab GTPases to be able to control the processes of
CC       membrane docking and fusion.
