CC       in which the prenyl chain synthesized by polyprenyl diphosphate
CC       synthase is transferred to 1,4-dihydroxy-2-naphthoate (DHNA).
CC   -!- The bacterial enzyme is an inner membrane protein, with the
CC       C-terminus located in the periplasm.
