DE   all-trans-octaprenyl-diphosphate synthase.
AN   octaprenyl pyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   terpenyl pyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   trans-heptaprenyltranstransferase.
AN   trans-prenyltransferase.
CA   5 isopentenyl diphosphate + (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate = all-trans-
CA   octaprenyl diphosphate + 5 diphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes the condensation reactions resulting in the
CC       formation of all-trans-octaprenyl diphosphate, the isoprenoid side
CC       chain of ubiquinone-8 and menaquinone-8.
CC   -!- The enzyme adds five isopentenyl diphosphate molecules sequentially
