DE   all-trans-decaprenyl-diphosphate synthase.
AN   decaprenyl-diphosphate synthase.
AN   decaprenyl pyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   polyprenylpyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   terpenoidallyltransferase.
AN   terpenyl pyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   trans-prenyltransferase.
CA   7 isopentenyl diphosphate + (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate = all-trans-
CA   decaprenyl diphosphate + 7 diphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes the condensation reactions resulting in the
CC       formation of all-trans-decaprenyl diphosphate, the isoprenoid side
CC       chain of ubiquinone-10 and menaquinone-10.
CC   -!- The enzyme adds seven isopentenyl diphosphate molecules sequentially
