DE   (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate synthase.
AN   cis,cis-farnesyl diphosphate synthase.
AN   Z,Z-farnesyl pyrophosphate synthase.
AN   Z,Z-FPP synthase.
AN   zFPS.
CA   2 isopentenyl diphosphate + dimethylallyl diphosphate = (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl
