DE   7-geranyloxy-5-hydroxy-2-methoxy-3-methylnaphthalene-1,4-dione synthase.
CA   2-O,3-dimethylflaviolin + (2E)-geranyl diphosphate + H(+) = 7-O-geranyl-
CA   2-O,3-dimethylflaviolin + diphosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in furaquinocin biosynthesis in the bacterium
CC       Streptomyces sp. KO-3988.
CC   -!- It catalyzes the transfer of a geranyl group to 2-O,3-
CC       dimethylflaviolin to yield 7-O-geranyl-2-O,3-dimethylflaviolin and
CC       6-linalyl-2-O,3-dimethylflaviolin (cf. EC 2.5.1.124) in a 1:10 ratio.
DR   Q2L6E3, FUR7_STREO ;
//
ID   2.5.1.126
DE   norspermine synthase.
AN   long-chain polyamine synthase.
CA   norspermidine + S-adenosyl 3-(methylsulfanyl)propylamine = norspermine +
CA   S-methyl-5'-thioadenosine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the thermophilic archaeon Pyrobaculum
CC       aerophilum, can also synthesize norspermidine from propane-1,3-
CC       diamine and thermospermine from spermidine (with lower activity).
CC   -!- The long-chain polyamines stabilize double-stranded DNA at high
CC       temperatures.
CC   -!- In contrast to EC 2.5.1.127, this enzyme does not accept norspermine
CC       as a substrate.
DR   A2BIX4, SPEE1_HYPBU;  Q8ZXM4, SPEE_PYRAE ;  Q9UXE4, SPEE_SACS2 ;
DR   Q5SK28, SPEE_THET8 ;
//
ID   2.5.1.127
DE   caldopentamine synthase.
AN   long-chain polyamine synthase.
CA   norspermine + S-adenosyl 3-(methylsulfanyl)propylamine = caldopentamine +
CA   S-methyl-5'-thioadenosine + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the thermophilic archaeon Hyperthermus
CC       butylicus, can also synthesize norspermine from norspermidine and
CC       thermospermine from spermidine (with lower activity).
CC   -!- The long-chain polyamines stabilize double-stranded DNA at high
CC       temperatures.
CC   -!- In contrast to EC 2.5.1.23 and EC 2.5.1.126, this enzyme shows no
CC       activity with propane-1,3-diamine.
DR   A2BIX4, SPEE1_HYPBU;
//
ID   2.5.1.128
DE   N(4)-bis(aminopropyl)spermidine synthase.
CA   2 S-adenosyl 3-(methylsulfanyl)propylamine + spermidine = N(4)-
CA   bis(aminopropyl)spermidine + 2 S-methyl-5'-thioadenosine + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the thermophilic archaeon Thermococcus
CC       kodakarensis, synthesizes the branched-chain polyamine N(4)-
CC       bis(aminopropyl)spermidine, which is required for cell growth at
CC       high-temperature.
CC   -!- When spermine is used as substrate, the enzyme forms N(4)-
CC       aminopropylspermine.
DR   Q58669, BPSA_METJA ;  Q5JIZ3, BPSA_THEKO ;  P25125, BPSA_THETH ;
//
ID   2.5.1.129
DE   flavin prenyltransferase.
CA   dimethylallyl phosphate + FMNH2 = prenylated FMNH2 + phosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme produces the modified flavin cofactor prenylated FMNH2,
CC       which is required by EC 4.1.1.98 and EC 4.1.1.102.
CC   -!- The enzyme acts as a flavin prenyltransferase, linking a prenyl
CC       moiety to the flavin N-5 and C-6 atoms and thus adding a fourth non-
CC       aromatic ring to the flavin isoalloxazine group.
