AN   ACEGA synthase.
CA   O-phospho-L-serine + L-glutamate = N-[(2S)-2-amino-2-carboxyethyl]-L-
CA   glutamate + phosphate + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Staphylococcus aureus,
CC       is involved in the biosynthesis of the siderophore staphyloferrin B.
