DE   hexaprenyl diphosphate synthase (prenyl-diphosphate specific).
AN   HexPPS.
CA   5 isopentenyl diphosphate + dimethylallyl diphosphate = all-trans-
CA   hexaprenyl diphosphate + 5 diphosphate.
CC   -!- This activity has been characterized from a number of fungal
CC       bifunctional enzymes.
CC   -!- Following the formation of hexaprenyl diphosphate, a different domain
