ID   2.5.1.159
DE   hapalindole G dimethylallyltransferase.
CA   (1) hapalindole G + dimethylallyl diphosphate = ambiguine A +
CA   diphosphate.
CA   (2) hapalindole U + dimethylallyl diphosphate + H(+) = ambiguine H +
CA   diphosphate.
CC   -!- Requires Mg(2+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the cyanobacterium Fischerella ambigua
CC       UTEX 1903, is involved in the biosynthesis of hapalindole-type
CC       alkaloids.
