ID   2.5.1.160
DE   plant cystathionine gamma-synthase.
CA   O-phospho-L-homoserine + L-cysteine = L,L-cystathionine + phosphate.
CC   -!- A pyridoxal 5'-phosphate-dependent enzyme, found in plants, that
