CA   hydroxyphenyl)pyruvate + L-glutamate.
CC   -!- Also acts on 3,5-dichloro-, 3,5-dibromo- and 3-iodo-L-tyrosine,
CC       thyroxine and triiodothyronine.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.6.1.25.
//
ID   2.6.1.25
DE   Transferred entry: 2.6.1.24.
//
ID   2.6.1.26
