ID   2.6.1.92
DE   UDP-4-amino-4,6-dideoxy-N-acetyl-beta-L-altrosamine transaminase.
AN   UDP-4-dehydro-6-deoxy-D-glucose transaminase.
AN   UDP-beta-L-threo-pentapyranos-4-ulose transaminase.
