ID   2.7.1.48
DE   uridine/cytidine kinase.
AN   uridine-cytidine kinase.
CA   (1) uridine + ATP = UMP + ADP + H(+).
CA   (2) cytidine + ATP = CMP + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in prokaryotes and eukaryotes, phosphorylates both
CC       uridine and cytidine to their monophosphate forms.
