ID   2.7.1.147
DE   ADP-specific glucose/glucosamine kinase.
AN   ADP-dependent glucokinase.
AN   ADP-specific glucokinase.
CA   (1) D-glucose + ADP = D-glucose 6-phosphate + AMP + H(+).
CA   (2) D-glucosamine + ADP = D-glucosamine 6-phosphate + AMP + H(+).
CC   -!- Requires Mg(2+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from a number of hyperthermophilic archaeal
