AN   adenylyltransferase.
AN   D-beta-D-heptose 7-phosphotransferase.
AN   glycero-manno-heptose 7-phosphate kinase.
AN   heptose 7-phosphate kinase.
AN   HldE1 heptokinase.
CA   D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose 7-phosphate + ATP = D-glycero-beta-D-
CA   manno-heptose 1,7-bisphosphate + ADP + H(+).
