DE   4-hydroxytryptamine kinase.
CA   4-hydroxytryptamine + ATP = norbaeocystin + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- Also acts on 4-hydroxy-L-tryptophan in vitro.
CC   -!- Isolated from the fungus Psilocybe cubensis.
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of the psychoactive compound psilocybin.
DR   P0DPA8, PSIK_PSICU ;  A0A286LEZ6, PSIK_PSICY ;
//
ID   2.7.1.223
DE   aminoimidazole riboside kinase.
CA   5-amino-1-(beta-D-ribosyl)imidazole + ATP = 5-amino-1-(5-phospho-beta-D-
CA   ribosyl)imidazole + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Salmonella enterica,
CC       can phosphorylate exogeneously-provided 5-amino-1-(beta-D-
CC       ribosyl)imidazole to form 5-amino-1-(5-phospho-beta-D-
CC       ribosyl)imidazole (AIR), an important intermediate in the production
CC       of both purine mononucleotides and the hydroxymethyl pyrimidine
CC       moiety of thiamine.
