DR   O34640, AMIN_BACSU ;
//
ID   2.7.1.231
DE   3-oxoisoapionate kinase.
CA   3-oxoisoapionate + ATP = 3-oxoisoapionate 4-phosphate + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from several bacterial species,
CC       participates in the degradation of D-apionate.
