CA   (2) dCMP + ATP = dCDP + ADP.
CA   (3) UMP + ATP = UDP + ADP.
CC   -!- This eukaryotic enzyme is a bifunctional enzyme that catalyzes the
CC       phosphorylation of both CMP and UMP with similar efficiency.
CC   -!- dCMP can also act as acceptor.
CC   -!- Different from the monofunctional prokaryotic enzymes EC 2.7.4.25 and
CC       EC 2.7.4.22.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.4.5.
