ID   2.7.4.20
DE   dolichyl-diphosphate--polyphosphate phosphotransferase.
CA   a di-trans,poly-cis-dolichyl diphosphate + [phosphate](n) =
CA   [phosphate](n+1) + a di-trans,poly-cis-dolichyl phosphate.
//
ID   2.7.4.21
