ID   2.7.4.26
DE   isopentenyl phosphate kinase.
CA   isopentenyl phosphate + ATP = isopentenyl diphosphate + ADP.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the mevalonate pathway in Archaea.
CC   -!- The activity has also been identified in the plant Mentha piperita
CC       (peppermint).
CC   -!- It is strictly specific for ATP but can use other phosphate acceptors
CC       such as prenyl phosphate, geranyl phosphate, or fosfomycin.
