//
ID   2.7.4.27
DE   ([Pyruvate, phosphate dikinase] phosphate) phosphotransferase.
AN   bifunctional dikinase regulatory protein.
AN   PPDK regulatory protein.
AN   pyruvate, phosphate dikinase regulatory protein.
CA   N(tele)-phospho-L-histidyl/O-phospho-L-threonyl-[pyruvate, phosphate
CA   dikinase] + phosphate + H(+) = N(tele)-phospho-L-histidyl/L-threonyl-
CA   [pyruvate, phosphate dikinase] + diphosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the plants maize and Arabidopsis is bifunctional and
CC       also catalyzes the phosphorylation of pyruvate, phosphate dikinase
CC       (EC 2.7.9.1), cf. EC 2.7.11.32.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.4.n1.
