DE   polynucleotide adenylyltransferase.
AN   NTP polymerase.
AN   poly(A) polymerase.
AN   RNA adenylating enzyme.
CA   RNA(n) + ATP = RNA(n)-3'-adenine ribonucleotide + diphosphate.
CC   -!- Also acts slowly with CTP.
CC   -!- Catalyzes template-independent extension of the 3'-end of a RNA
CC       strand by one nucleotide at a time.
CC   -!- Cannot initiate a chain de novo.
CC   -!- The primer, depending on the source of the enzyme, may be an RNA or
CC       DNA fragment or oligo(A) bearing a 3'-OH terminal group.
CC   -!- See also EC 2.7.7.6.
