ID   2.7.7.31
DE   DNA nucleotidylexotransferase.
AN   terminal addition enzyme.
AN   terminal deoxynucleotidyltransferase.
AN   terminal deoxyribonucleotidyltransferase.
AN   terminal transferase.
CA   DNA(n) + a 2'-deoxyribonucleoside 5'-triphosphate = DNA(n+1) +
CA   diphosphate.
CC   -!- Catalyzes template-independent extension of the 3'-end of a DNA
CC       strand by one nucleotide at a time.
CC   -!- Cannot initiate a chain de novo.
CC   -!- Nucleoside may be ribo- or deoxyribo-.
