ID   2.7.7.32
DE   galactose-1-phosphate thymidylyltransferase.
AN   dTDP-galactose diphosphorylase.
AN   dTDP-galactose pyrophosphorylase.
CA   alpha-D-galactose 1-phosphate + dTTP + H(+) = dTDP-D-galactose +
CA   diphosphate.
