AN   revertase.
CA   DNA(n) + a 2'-deoxyribonucleoside 5'-triphosphate = DNA(n+1) +
CA   diphosphate.
CC   -!- Catalyzes RNA-template-directed extension of the 3'-end of a DNA
CC       strand by one deoxynucleotide at a time.
CC   -!- Cannot initiate a chain de novo.
CC   -!- Requires a RNA or DNA primer.
CC   -!- DNA can also serve as template.
CC   -!- See also EC 2.7.7.7.
