DE   [glutamine synthetase]-adenylyl-L-tyrosine phosphorylase.
CA   [glutamine synthetase]-O(4)-(5'-adenylyl)-L-tyrosine + phosphate =
CA   [glutamine synthetase]-L-tyrosine + ADP.
