CA   sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine = 7-O-
CA   [2-aminoethoxy(hydroxy)phosphoryl]-alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-
CA   lipid A + a 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycerol.
CA   (2) alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid IVA (E. coli) + a 1,2-diacyl-
CA   sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine = 7-O-
CA   [2-aminoethoxy(hydroxy)phosphoryl]-alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-
CA   lipid IVA (E. coli) + a 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycerol.
CC   -!- The enzyme has been characterized from the bacterium Escherichia
CC       coli.
DR   P37661, EPTB_ECOLI ;  P43666, EPTB_SALTY ;
