ID   2.7.8.44
DE   teichoic acid glycerol-phosphate primase.
AN   Tag primase.
CA   N-acetyl-beta-D-mannosaminyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosaminyl
CA   di-trans,octa-cis-undecaprenyl diphosphate + CDP-glycerol = 4-O-[(2R)-
CA   glycerylphospho]-N-acetyl-beta-D-mannosaminyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-alpha-D-
CA   glucosaminyl di-trans,octa-cis-undecaprenyl diphosphate + CMP + H(+).
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of teichoic acid linkage units in
CC       bacterial cell walls.
CC   -!- This enzyme adds the first glycerol unit to the disaccharide linker
CC       of the teichoic acid.
DR   P27621, TAGB_BACSU ;  Q8RKI8, TARB_BACSH ;  Q2G2X4, TARB_STAA8 ;
