ID   2.7.8.45
DE   teichoic acid glycerol-phosphate transferase.
AN   teichoic acid glycerol-phosphate primase.
CA   4-O-[(2R)-glycerylphospho]-N-acetyl-beta-D-mannosaminyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-
CA   alpha-D-glucosaminyl di-trans,octa-cis-undecaprenyl diphosphate + CDP-
CA   glycerol = 4-O-[di(2R)-glycerylphospho]-N-acetyl-beta-D-mannosaminyl-
CA   (1->4)-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosaminyl di-trans,octa-cis-undecaprenyl
CA   diphosphate + CMP + H(+).
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of teichoic acid linkage units in the
CC       cell walls of some bacteria such as Staphylococcus aureus.
CC   -!- This enzyme adds a second glycerol unit to the disaccharide linker of
