ID   2.7.11.6
DE   [tyrosine 3-monooxygenase] kinase.
AN   pheochromocytoma tyrosine hydroxylase-associated kinase.
AN   tyrosine 3-monooxygenase kinase (phosphorylating).
CA   L-seryl-[tyrosine-3-monooxygenase] + ATP = O-phospho-L-seryl-[tyrosine-3-
CA   monooxygenase] + ADP + H(+).
CC   -!- Has no activating compound but is specific for its substrate, with
CC       which it copurifies.
CC   -!- Activates EC 1.14.16.2 by phosphorylation.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.1.124.
