ID   2.8.1.14
DE   tRNA-5-taurinomethyluridine 2-sulfurtransferase.
CA   5-taurinomethyluridine(34) in tRNA + S-sulfanyl-L-cysteinyl-[protein] +
CA   AH2 + ATP = 5-taurinomethyl-2-thiouridine(34) in tRNA + L-cysteinyl-
CA   [protein] + A + AMP + diphosphate + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in mitochondria, catalyzes formation of
CC       5-taurinomethyl-2-thiouridine in the wobble position of mitochondrial
CC       tRNA(Gln), tRNA(Lys) and tRNA(Glu).
DR   Q17440, MTU1_CAEEL ;  Q5ZKW0, MTU1_CHICK ;  Q503J2, MTU1_DANRE ;
