CC       the N-unsubstituted glucosamine residue (shown with an asterisk).
CC   -!- Modification of selected sequences containing N-sulfo-glucosamine
CC       residues cannot yet be excluded.
CC   -!- The 3-O-sulfated heparan sulfate can be utilized by Herpes simplex
