DE   acetylajmaline esterase.
AN   2beta(R)-17-O-acetylajmalan:acetylesterase.
AN   AAE.
AN   acetylajmalan esterase.
CA   (1) 17-O-acetylajmaline + H2O = ajmaline + acetate + H(+).
CA   (2) 17-O-acetylnorajmaline + H2O = norajmaline + acetate + H(+).
CC   -!- Responsible for the last stages in the biosynthesis of the indole
CC       alkaloid ajmaline.
CC   -!- Highly specific for the substrates 17-O-acetylajmaline and 17-O-
CC       acetylnorajmaline as the structurally related acetylated alkaloids
CC       vinorine, vomilenine, 1,2-dihydrovomilenine and 1,2-
CC       dihydroraucaffricine cannot act as substrates.
