ID   3.1.1.116
DE   sn-1-specific diacylglycerol lipase.
CA   a 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycerol + H2O = a 2-acylglycerol + a fatty acid + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, present in animals, is specific for the sn-1 position.
CC   -!- When acting on 1-acyl-2-arachidonoyl-sn-glycerol, the enzyme forms
CC       2-arachidonoylglycerol, the most abundant endocannabinoid in the
CC       mammalian brain.
