AN   4-O-methyl-glucuronoyl methylesterase.
AN   glucuronoyl esterase.
AN   glucuronoyl-lignin ester hydrolase.
CA   a 4-O-methyl-alpha-D-glucuronosyl ester derivative + H2O = 4-O-methyl-
CA   alpha-D-glucuronate derivative + an alcohol + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme occurs in microorganisms and catalyzes the cleavage of the
