ID   3.1.3.16
DE   protein-serine/threonine phosphatase.
AN   protein phosphatase-1.
AN   protein phosphatase-2A.
AN   protein phosphatase-2B.
AN   protein phosphatase-2C.
AN   serine/threonine specific protein phosphatase.
CA   (1) O-phospho-L-seryl-[protein] + H2O = L-seryl-[protein] + phosphate.
CA   (2) O-phospho-L-threonyl-[protein] + H2O = L-threonyl-[protein] +
CA   phosphate.
CC   -!- A group of enzymes removing the serine- or threonine-bound phosphate
CC       group from a wide range of phosphoproteins, including a number of
CC       enzymes which have been phosphorylated under the action of a kinase
CC       (cf. EC 3.1.3.48).
CC   -!- The spleen enzyme also acts on phenolic phosphates and phosphamides
CC       (cf. EC 3.9.1.1).
