DE   sucrose-phosphate phosphatase.
AN   SPP.
AN   sucrose-6-phosphate phosphatase.
AN   sucrose phosphatase.
CA   sucrose 6(F)-phosphate + H2O = sucrose + phosphate.
CC   -!- This is the final step in the sucrose-biosynthesis pathway.
CC   -!- Highly specific for sucrose 6-phosphate, with fructose 6-phosphate
