CA   chain] + phosphate.
CA   (2) O-phospho-L-threonyl-[myosin light chain] + H2O = L-threonyl-[myosin
CA   light chain] + phosphate.
CC   -!- Composed of three subunits.
CC   -!- The holoenzyme dephosphorylates myosin light chains and EC 2.7.11.31,
CC       but not myosin; the catalytic subunit acts on all three substrates.
