CC       (PtdIns(3,4,5)P3) to produce PtdIns(3,4)P2, thereby negatively
CC       regulating the PI3K (phosphoinositide 3-kinase) pathways.
CC   -!- The enzyme also shows activity toward PtdIns(1,3,4,5)P4.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in several signal transduction pathways in the
CC       immune system leading to an adverse range of effects.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.1.3.n1.
