CA   H2O = 3-deoxy-D-glycero-beta-D-galacto-non-2-ulopyranosonate + phosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Bacteroides
CC       thetaiotaomicron, is part of the biosynthesis pathway of the sialic
CC       acid 3-deoxy-D-glycero-beta-D-galacto-non-2-ulopyranosonate (Kdn).
CC   -!- Kdn is abundant in extracellular glycoconjugates of lower vertebrates
CC       such as fish and amphibians, but is also found in the capsular
