CC   -!- The enzyme, studied from mycobacteria, in involved in the
CC       biosynthesis of trans,octacis-decaprenylphospho-beta-D-
CC       arabinofuranose, which serves in those organisms as the
CC       arabinofuranose donor for the biosynthesis of the cell wall polymers
CC       arabinogalactan and lipoarabinomannan.
DR   A0R627, DPRP_MYCS2 ;  P9WI52, DPRP_MYCTO ;  P9WI53, DPRP_MYCTU ;
//
ID   3.1.3.112
DE   4'-phosphooxetanocin A phosphatase.
