DE   cyclic-di-AMP phosphodiesterase.
CA   3',3'-c-di-AMP + H2O = 5'-O-phosphonoadenylyl-(3'->5')-adenosine + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, described from Gram-positive bacteria, degrades the
