ID   3.1.26.8
DE   ribonuclease M5.
AN   5S ribosomal maturation nuclease.
AN   RNase M5.
CA   Endonucleolytic cleavage of RNA, removing 21 and 42 nucleotides,
CA   respectively, from the 5'- and 3'-termini of a 5S-rRNA precursor.
CC   -!- Converts the 5S-rRNA precursor from Bacillus subtilis into 5S-rRNA,
CC       with 5'-phosphate and 3'-hydroxy groups.
