CC   -!- This family of mammalian enzymes, located in the Golgi system,
CC       participates in the maturation process of N-glycans that leads to
CC       formation of hybrid and complex structures.
CC   -!- The enzymes catalyze the hydrolysis of the four (1->2)-linked alpha-
CC       D-mannose residues from the Man9GlcNAc2 oligosaccharide attached to
CC       target proteins.
CC   -!- Alternatively, the enzymes act on the Man8GlcNAc2 isomer formed by
CC       EC 3.2.1.209.
