CC       inverting mechanism.
CC   -!- While all three human enzymes can catalyze the reactions listed here,
CC       some of the enzymes can additionally catalyze hydrolysis in an
CC       alternative order, generating additional isomeric intermediates,
CC       although the final product is the same.
CC   -!- The names of the isomers listed here are based on a nomenclature
CC       system proposed by Prien et al.
