CC       (2->1)-beta-D-fructofuranosyl-(2->1)-beta-D-fructofuranosyl alpha-D-
CC       glucopyranoside), some (but not all) levan-type fructans can also be
CC       hydrolyzed, but more slowly (see EC 3.2.1.154).
CC   -!- Sucrose, while being a very poor substrate, can substantially inhibit
CC       enzyme activity in some cases.
DR   Q84PN8, 1FEH1_WHEAT;  Q84LA1, 1FEH2_WHEAT;  B6DZC8, 1FEH3_WHEAT;
