ID   3.4.11.1
DE   leucyl aminopeptidase.
AN   cytosol aminopeptidase.
AN   leucine aminopeptidase.
AN   peptidase S.
CA   Release of an N-terminal amino acid, Xaa-|-Yaa-, in which Xaa is
CA   preferably Leu, but may be other amino acids including Pro although not
CA   Arg or Lys, and Yaa may be Pro. Amino acid amides and methyl esters are
CA   also readily hydrolyzed, but rates on arylamides are exceedingly low.
CC   -!- Is activated by heavy metal ions.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family M17.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.1.1.
