ID   3.4.11.2
DE   membrane alanyl aminopeptidase.
AN   amino-oligopeptidase.
AN   aminopeptidase M.
AN   aminopeptidase N.
AN   membrane alanine aminopeptidase.
AN   membrane aminopeptidase I.
AN   microsomal aminopeptidase.
AN   particle-bound aminopeptidase.
AN   peptidase E.
CA   Release of an N-terminal amino acid, Xaa-|-Yaa- from a peptide, amide or
CA   arylamide. Xaa is preferably Ala, but may be most amino acids including
CA   Pro (slow action). When a terminal hydrophobic residue is followed by a
CA   prolyl residue, the two may be released as an intact Xaa-Pro dipeptide.
CC   -!- Is not activated by heavy metal ions.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family M1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.1.2, EC 3.4.3.5 and EC 3.4.13.6.
