ID   3.4.13.4
DE   Xaa-Arg dipeptidase.
AN   aminoacyl-lysine dipeptidase.
AN   N(2)-(4-amino-butyryl)-L-lysine hydrolase.
AN   X-Arg dipeptidase.
CA   (1) beta-alanyl-L-lysine + H2O = beta-alanine + L-lysine.
CA   (2) beta-alanyl-L-ornithine + H2O = beta-alanine + L-ornithine.
CA   (3) beta-alanyl-L-arginine + H2O = beta-alanine + L-arginine.
CA   (4) N(2)-(4-aminobutanoyl)-L-lysine + H2O = 4-aminobutanoate + L-lysine.
CA   (5) N(2)-(4-aminobutanoyl)-L-ornithine + H2O = 4-aminobutanoate +
CA   L-ornithine.
CA   (6) N(2)-(4-aminobutanoyl)-L-arginine + H2O = 4-aminobutanoate +
CA   L-arginine.
CC   -!- Widely distributed in mammals.
DR   Q8IYS1, P20D2_HUMAN;  A3KG59, P20D2_MOUSE;
