DE   leukotriene-C4 hydrolase.
AN   gamma-glutamyl leukotrienase.
CA   leukotriene C4 + H2O = leukotriene D4 + L-glutamate.
CC   -!- The mouse enzyme is specific for leukotriene C4, while the human
CC       enzyme also has considerable activity toward glutathione and oxidized
CC       glutathione (cf. EC 3.4.19.13).
