ID   3.4.21.57
DE   leucyl endopeptidase.
AN   leucine-specific serine proteinase.
AN   plant Leu-proteinase.
CA   Hydrolysis of proteins. Preferential cleavage: Leu-|-Xaa in small
CA   molecule substrates.
CC   -!- The enzyme from spinach leaves shows high specificity for leucine in
CC       peptides and 4-nitroanilides.
//
ID   3.4.21.58
DE   Deleted entry.
