ID   3.4.21.63
DE   oryzin.
AN   aspergillopeptidase B.
AN   Aspergillus alkaline proteinase.
CA   Hydrolysis of proteins with broad specificity, and of Bz-Arg-OEt >
CA   Ac-Tyr-OEt. Does not hydrolyze peptide amides.
CC   -!- Predominant extracellular alkaline endopeptidase of the mold
CC       Aspergillus oryzae.
CC   -!- Identical or closely related enzymes are produced by A.flavus and
CC       A.sojae.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S8.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.4.16, EC 3.4.21.14 and EC 3.4.21.15.
