ID   3.4.21.64
DE   peptidase K.
AN   endopeptidase K.
AN   proteinase K.
AN   Tritirachium album proteinase K.
AN   Tritirachium alkaline proteinase.
CA   Hydrolysis of keratin, and of other proteins with subtilisin-like
CA   specificity. Hydrolyzes peptide amides.
CC   -!- From the mold Tritirachium album Limber.
CC   -!- Contains two disulfide bridges and one free Cys near the active site
CC       His.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S8.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.4.16 and EC 3.4.21.14.
DR   P06873, PRTK_PARAQ ;
