ID   3.4.21.70
DE   pancreatic endopeptidase E.
AN   cholesterol-binding proteinase.
AN   elastase III.
CA   Preferential cleavage: Ala-|-Xaa. Does not hydrolyze elastin.
CC   -!- From pancreatic juice.
CC   -!- Unlike elastases, has an acidic pI.
CC   -!- Binds cholesterol.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1.
DR   P09093, CEL3A_HUMAN;  P08861, CEL3B_HUMAN;  O19023, CEL3B_MACMU;
DR   Q9CQ52, CEL3B_MOUSE;
