ID   3.4.21.71
DE   pancreatic elastase II.
CA   Preferential cleavage: Leu-|-Xaa, Met-|-Xaa and Phe-|-Xaa. Hydrolyzes
CA   elastin.
CC   -!- Formed by activation of proelastase II from mammalian pancreas by
CC       trypsin.
CC   -!- Usually, only one of the pancreatic elastases (see also EC 3.4.21.36)
CC       is expressed in a given species; human pancreatic elastase is of type
CC       II.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1.
DR   Q29461, CEL2A_BOVIN;  P08217, CEL2A_HUMAN;  P05208, CEL2A_MOUSE;
DR   P08419, CEL2A_PIG  ;  P00774, CEL2A_RAT  ;  P08218, CEL2B_HUMAN;
