ID   3.4.21.75
DE   furin.
AN   dibasic processing enzyme.
AN   paired basic amino acid residue cleaving enzyme.
AN   prohormone convertase.
CA   Release of mature proteins from their proproteins by cleavage of -Arg-
CA   Xaa-Yaa-Arg-|-Zaa- bonds, where Xaa can be any amino acid and Yaa is Arg
CA   or Lys. Releases albumin, complement component C3 and von Willebrand
CA   factor from their respective precursors.
CC   -!- Activated by calcium.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S8.
