CA   acids at P1 and P3.
CC   -!- Cleaves sterol regulatory element-binding proteins (SREBPs) and
CC       thereby initiates a process by which the active fragments of the
CC       SREBPs translocate to the nucleus and activate genes controlling the
CC       synthesis and uptake of cholesterol and unsaturated fatty acids into
CC       the bloodstream.
CC   -!- The enzyme also processes pro-brain-derived neurotrophic factor and
CC       undergoes autocatalytic activation in the endoplasmic reticulum
CC       through sequential cleavages.
CC   -!- The enzyme can also process the unfolded protein response stress
