CC   -!- In the equine arterivirus (EAV), the replicase gene is translated
CC       into open reading frame 1a (ORF1a) and ORF1ab polyproteins.
CC   -!- This enzyme is the main viral proteinase and processes five cleavage
CC       sites in the ORF1a protein and three in the ORF1b-encoded part of the
CC       ORF1ab protein to yield non-structural proteins (nsp5-nsp12).
