ID   3.4.22.31
DE   ananain.
CA   Hydrolysis of proteins with broad specificity for peptide bonds. Best
CA   reported small molecule substrate Bz-Phe-Val-Arg-|-NHMec, but broader
CA   specificity than fruit bromelain.
CC   -!- From stem of pineapple plant, Ananas comosus.
CC   -!- Differs from stem and fruit bromelains in being inhibited by chicken
CC       cystatin.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family C1.
DR   P80884, ANAN_ANACO ;
