CC       cohesin subunit Scc1 by separase is required for sister chromatid
CC       separation in mitosis.
CC   -!- S.cerevisiae separase is also known to cleave the Rec8 subunit of a
CC       meiotic cohesin complex and the kinetochore protein Slk19.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family C50.
