ID   3.4.22.67
DE   zingipain.
AN   ginger protease.
AN   GP-I.
AN   GP-II.
AN   zingibain.
CA   Preferential cleavage of peptides with a proline residue at the P2
CA   position.
CC   -!- Found in ginger (Zingiber officinale) rhizome and is a member of the
CC       papain family.
CC   -!- The enzyme is inhibited by some divalent metal ions, such as Hg(2+),
CC       Cu(2+), Cd(2+) and Zn(2+).
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family C1.
DR   P82473, CPGP1_ZINOF;  P82474, CPGP2_ZINOF;
