CA   and P1' positions. Cleaves 1-Phe-|-Val-2, 4-Gln-|-His-5, 13-Glu-|-Ala-14,
CA   14-Ala-|-Leu-15, 15-Leu-|-Tyr-16, 16-Tyr-|-Leu-17, 23-Gly-|-Phe-24,
CA   24-Phe-|-Phe-25 and 25-Phe-|-Tyr-26 bonds in the B chain of insulin.
CC   -!- The predominant endopeptidase in the gastric juice of vertebrates,
CC       formed from pepsinogen A by limited proteolysis.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family A1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.4.1.
