ID   3.5.1.109
DE   sphingomyelin deacylase.
AN   glucosylceramide sphingomyelin deacylase.
AN   SM deacylase.
AN   SMGCer deacylase.
AN   SM glucosylceramide GCer deacylase.
AN   sphingomyelin glucosylceramide deacylase.
CA   (1) a sphingomyelin + H2O = sphing-4-enine-phosphocholine +
CA   a carboxylate.
CA   (2) a beta-D-glucosyl-(1<->1')-N-acylsphing-4-enine + H2O = beta-D-
CA   glucosyl-(1<->1)-sphing-4-enine + a fatty acid.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the sphingolipid metabolism in the
CC       epidermis.
DR   Q13510, ASAH1_HUMAN;
