ID   3.5.1.111
DE   2-oxoglutaramate amidase.
AN   omega-amidase.
CA   2-oxoglutaramate + H2O = 2-oxoglutarate + NH4(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, which is highly specific for its substrate, participates
CC       in the nicotine degradation pathway of several Gram-positive
CC       bacteria.
