ID   3.5.2.1
DE   barbiturase.
CA   barbiturate + H2O = 3-oxo-3-ureidopropanoate.
CC   -!- Specific for barbiturate as substrate.
CC   -!- Forms part of the oxidative pyrimidine-degrading pathway in some
CC       microorganisms, along with EC 1.17.99.4 and EC 3.5.1.95.
CC   -!- It was previously thought that the end-products of the reaction were
CC       malonate and urea.
CC   -!- May be involved in the regulation of pyrimidine metabolism, along
CC       with EC 2.4.2.9.
