ID   3.5.2.18
DE   enamidase.
CA   1,4,5,6-tetrahydro-6-oxonicotinate + 2 H2O = 2-formylglutarate + NH4(+).
CC   -!- Forms part of the nicotinate-fermentation catabolism pathway in
CC       Eubacterium barkeri.
CC   -!- Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.1.5, EC 1.3.7.1,
CC       EC 1.1.1.291, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6, EC 4.2.1.85 and EC 4.1.3.32.
DR   Q0QLE9, ENA_EUBBA  ;
//
ID   3.5.2.19
DE   streptothricin hydrolase.
CA   streptothricin F + H2O = streptothricin F acid.
CC   -!- The enzyme also catalyzes the hydrolysis of streptothricin-D to
CC       streptothricin-D acid.
CC   -!- The enzyme is responsible for streptothricin resistance in
CC       Streptomyces albulus and Streptomyces noursei.
DR   Q1MW86, STTH1_STRNR;  C5NU54, STTH2_STRNR;
//
ID   3.5.2.20
DE   isatin hydrolase.
CA   isatin + H2O = isatinate + H(+).
CC   -!- This enzyme, found in several bacterial species, is involved in the
CC       degradation of indole-3-acetic acid.
DR   A0NLY7, ISAHY_ROSAI;
