ID   3.5.4.36
DE   mRNA(cytosine(6666)) deaminase.
AN   apolipoprotein B mRNA editing enzyme.
CA   cytidine(6666) in apoB mRNA + H2O + H(+) = uridine(6666) in apoB mRNA +
CA   NH4(+).
CC   -!- The apolipoprotein B mRNA editing enzyme complex catalyzes the
CC       editing of apolipoprotein B mRNA at cytidine(6666) to uridine,
CC       thereby transforming the codon for glutamine-2153 to a termination
CC       codon.
CC   -!- Editing results in translation of a truncated apolipoprotein B
CC       isoform (apoB-48) with distinct functions in lipid transport.
CC   -!- The catalytic component (APOBEC-1) contains zinc at the active site.
