DE   N-isopropylammelide isopropylaminohydrolase.
CA   N-isopropylammelide + H2O + H(+) = isopropylamine + cyanurate.
CC   -!- This bacterial enzyme is involved in degradation of the herbicide
CC       atrazine.
CC   -!- It can hydrolyze other N-substituted amino dihydroxy-s-triazine
CC       molecules, and prefers substrates with linear N-alkyl groups to those
CC       with branched alkyl groups.
