DE   2-aminomuconate deaminase.
CA   (2Z,4E)-2-aminomuconate + H2O = (3E)-2-oxohex-3-enedioate + NH4(+).
CC   -!- 2-aminomuconate is an intermediate in the bacterial biodegradation of
CC       nitrobenzene.
