CA   adenosine 5'-tetraphosphate + H2O = phosphate + ATP + H(+).
CC   -!- Also acts on inosine tetraphosphate and tripolyphosphate but shows
CC       little or no activity with other nucleotides or polyphosphates.
//
ID   3.6.1.15
DE   nucleoside-triphosphate phosphatase.
AN   NTPase.
AN   nucleoside 5-triphosphatase.
AN   nucleoside-5-triphosphate phosphohydrolase.
AN   nucleoside-triphosphatase.
AN   nucleoside triphosphate hydrolase.
AN   nucleoside triphosphate phosphohydrolase.
CA   a ribonucleoside 5'-triphosphate + H2O = a ribonucleoside 5'-diphosphate
CA   + phosphate + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is found in eukaryotes and thermophilic bacteria,
CC       but appears to be absent from mesophilic bacteria.
CC   -!- Also hydrolyzes nucleoside diphosphates, thiamine diphosphate and
CC       FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the plant Pisum sativum (garden pea) is regulated by
CC       calmodulin.
