ID   3.6.1.61
DE   diadenosine hexaphosphate hydrolase (ATP-forming).
CA   (1) P(1),P(6)-bis(5'-adenosyl) hexaphosphate + H2O = 2 ATP + 2 H(+).
CA   (2) P(1),P(5)-bis(5'-adenosyl) pentaphosphate + H2O = ADP + ATP + 2 H(+).
