//
ID   3.6.5.n1
DE   elongation factor 4.
CA   GTP + H2O = GDP + phosphate + H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is required for accurate and efficient protein synthesis
CC       under certain stress conditions.
CC   -!- May act as a fidelity factor of the translation reaction,
CC       by catalyzing a one-codon backward translocation of tRNAs on
CC       improperly translocated ribosomes.
CC   -!- Back-translocation proceeds from a post-translocation (POST) complex
CC       to a pre-translocation (PRE) complex, thus giving elongation factor G
CC       a second chance to translocate the tRNAs correctly.
CC   -!- Binds to ribosomes in a GTP-dependent manner.
