ID   4.1.1.40
DE   hydroxypyruvate decarboxylase.
AN   hydroxypyruvate carboxy-lyase.
CA   3-hydroxypyruvate + H(+) = glycolaldehyde + CO2.
//
ID   4.1.1.41
DE   Transferred entry: 7.2.4.3.
//
ID   4.1.1.42
DE   carnitine decarboxylase.
AN   carnitine carboxy-lyase.
CA   carnitine + H(+) = 2-methylcholine + CO2.
CC   -!- Requires ATP.
//
ID   4.1.1.43
DE   phenylpyruvate decarboxylase.
AN   phenylpyruvate carboxy-lyase.
CA   3-phenylpyruvate + H(+) = 2-phenylacetaldehyde + CO2.
CC   -!- Also acts on (indol-3-yl)pyruvate.
