CA   5-oxofuran-2-yl)-acetate + CO2.
DR   P20370, DC4C_ACIAD ;  P00881, DC4C_PSEPU ;
//
ID   4.1.1.45
DE   aminocarboxymuconate-semialdehyde decarboxylase.
AN   picolinic acid decarboxylase.
CA   2-amino-3-carboxymuconate 6-semialdehyde + H(+) = 2-aminomuconate
CA   6-semialdehyde + CO2.
CC   -!- The product rearranges non-enzymically to picolinate.
