ID   4.1.1.46
DE   o-pyrocatechuate decarboxylase.
AN   2,3-DHBA decarboxylase.
AN   2,3-dihydroxybenzoate carboxy-lyase.
AN   2,3-dihydroxybenzoic acid decarboxylase.
CA   2,3-dihydroxybenzoate + H(+) = catechol + CO2.
DR   P80346, DBD23_ASPNG;  P80402, DBD23_ASPOR;
//
ID   4.1.1.47
DE   tartronate-semialdehyde synthase.
AN   glyoxylate carboligase.
