//
ID   4.1.1.54
DE   dihydroxyfumarate decarboxylase.
AN   dihydroxyfumarate carboxy-lyase.
CA   dihydroxyfumarate + H(+) = 2-hydroxy-3-oxopropanoate + CO2.
//
ID   4.1.1.55
DE   4,5-dihydroxyphthalate decarboxylase.
AN   4,5-dihydroxyphthalate carboxy-lyase.
CA   4,5-dihydroxyphthalate + H(+) = 3,4-dihydroxybenzoate + CO2.
DR   Q05185, PHT5_PSEPU ;  Q59727, PHTD_COMTE ;
//
ID   4.1.1.56
DE   3-oxolaurate decarboxylase.
AN   3-oxododecanoate carboxy-lyase.
AN   beta-ketoacyl decarboxylase.
AN   beta-ketolaurate decarboxylase.
CA   3-oxododecanoate + H(+) = 2-undecanone + CO2.
CC   -!- Also decarboxylates other C14 to C16 oxo acids.
//
ID   4.1.1.57
DE   methionine decarboxylase.
AN   L-methionine carboxy-lyase.
AN   L-methionine decarboxylase.
CA   L-methionine + H(+) = 3-(methylsulfanyl)propanamine + CO2.
//
ID   4.1.1.58
DE   orsellinate decarboxylase.
AN   orsellinate carboxy-lyase.
CA   orsellinate + H(+) = orcinol + CO2.
//
ID   4.1.1.59
DE   gallate decarboxylase.
AN   gallate carboxy-lyase.
AN   gallic acid decarboxylase.
CA   3,4,5-trihydroxybenzoate + H(+) = 1,2,3-trihydroxybenzene + CO2.
DR   F9US27, LPDC_LACPL ;
//
ID   4.1.1.60
DE   stipitatonate decarboxylase.
CA   stipitatonate + H2O = stipitatate + CO2.
//
ID   4.1.1.61
DE   4-hydroxybenzoate decarboxylase.
AN   4-hydroxybenzoate carboxy-lyase.
