DE   4-hydroxy-3-polyprenylbenzoate decarboxylase.
AN   3-octaprenyl-4-hydroxybenzoate decarboxylase.
AN   4-hydroxy-3-solanesylbenzoate decarboxylase.
CA   a 4-hydroxy-3-(all-trans-polyprenyl)benzoate + H(+) = a 2-(all-trans-
CA   polyprenyl)phenol + CO2.
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a step in prokaryotic ubiquinone biosynthesis,
