DE   (4S)-4-hydroxy-2-oxoglutarate aldolase.
AN   2-keto-4-hydroxyglutaric aldolase.
AN   4-hydroxy-2-ketoglutaric aldolase.
AN   hydroxyketoglutaric aldolase.
CA   (4S)-4-hydroxy-2-oxoglutarate = glyoxylate + pyruvate.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the bacterium Escherichia coli is specific for the
CC       (S) enantiomer.
CC   -!- That enzyme is trifunctional, and also catalyzes the reactions of
CC       EC 4.1.1.3 and EC 4.1.2.14. cf. EC 4.1.3.16.
DR   P0A957, ALKH_ECO57 ;  P0A956, ALKH_ECOL6 ;  P0A955, ALKH_ECOLI ;
DR   P0A958, ALKH_SHIFL ;
