DE   aldehyde oxygenase (deformylating).
AN   aldehyde decarbonylase.
CA   a long-chain fatty aldehyde + 2 NADPH + O2 + H(+) = a long-chain alkane +
CA   formate + 2 NADP(+) + H2O.
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of alkanes.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the cyanobacterium Nostoc punctiforme PCC 73102 is
CC       only active in vitro in the presence of ferredoxin, ferredoxin
