CA   dihydroguanosine 5'-triphosphate + 5'-deoxyadenosine + L-methionine + A +
CA   H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes an early step in the biosynthesis of the
CC       molybdenum cofactor (MoCo).
CC   -!- The enzyme belongs to the superfamily of radical S-adenosyl-L-
CC       methionine (radical SAM) enzymes.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 4.1.99.18.
