ID   4.2.1.3
DE   aconitate hydratase.
AN   aconitase.
AN   cis-aconitase.
AN   citrate(isocitrate) hydro-lyase.
AN   citrate hydro-lyase.
CA   citrate = D-threo-isocitrate.
CC   -!- Besides interconverting citrate and cis-aconitate, it also
CC       interconverts cis-aconitate with isocitrate and, hence, interconverts
CC       citrate and isocitrate.
CC   -!- The equilibrium mixture is 91% citrate, 6% isocitrate and 3%
CC       aconitate.
CC   -!- cis-aconitate is used to designate the isomer (Z)-prop-1-ene-1,2,3-
CC       tricarboxylate.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 4.2.1.4.
