DE   hydroperoxide dehydratase.
AN   allene oxide synthase.
AN   AOS.
AN   hydroperoxide isomerase.
CA   (13S)-hydroperoxy-(9Z,11E,15Z)-octadecatrienoate = (9Z,13S,15Z)-12,13-
CA   epoxyoctadeca-9,11,15-trienoate + H2O.
CC   -!- Acts on a number of unsaturated fatty-acid hydroperoxides, forming
CC       the corresponding allene oxides.
CC   -!- The product of the above reaction is unstable and is acted upon by
CC       EC 5.3.99.6 to form the cyclopentenone derivative (15Z)-12-oxophyto-
CC       10,15-dienoate (OPDA), which is the first cyclic and biologically
CC       active metabolite in the jasmonate biosynthesis pathway.
