ID   4.2.1.105
DE   2-hydroxyisoflavanone dehydratase.
CA   (1) (2R,3S)-2,4',7-trihydroxyisoflavanone = daidzein + H2O + H(+).
CA   (2) 2-hydroxy-2,3-dihydrogenistein = genistein + H2O + H(+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the final step in the formation of the isoflavonoid
CC       skeleton.
CC   -!- The reaction also occurs spontaneously.
DR   Q5NUF3, HIDH_SOYBN ;  Q5NUF4, HIDM_GLYEC ;
