ID   4.2.1.106
DE   bile-acid 7alpha-dehydratase.
AN   BA7 alpha dehydratase.
CA   7alpha,12alpha-dihydroxy-3-oxochol-4-en-24-oyl-CoA = 12alpha-hydroxy-3-
CA   oxochola-4,6-dien-24-oyl-CoA + H2O.
CC   -!- This enzyme, characterized from the gut bacterium Clostridium
CC       scindens (previously known as Eubacterium sp. strain VPI 12708),
CC       participates in the 7-dehydroxylation process associated with bile
CC       acid degradation.
DR   P19412, BAIE_CLOSV ;
