ID   4.2.1.107
DE   3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA hydratase.
AN   D-3-hydroxyacyl-CoA dehydratase.
CA   (24R,25R)-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24-tetrahydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-oyl-
CA   CoA = (24E)-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-en-26-oyl-
CA   CoA + H2O.
CC   -!- Forms part of the rat peroxisomal multifunctional enzyme perMFE-2,
CC       which also exhibits a dehydrogenase activity.
CC   -!- Involved in the beta-oxidation of the cholesterol side chain in the
CC       cholic-acid biosynthesis pathway.
DR   P51659, DHB4_HUMAN ;  P51660, DHB4_MOUSE ;  P97852, DHB4_RAT   ;
