DE   carotenoid 1,2-hydratase.
CA   (1) rhodopin = all-trans-lycopene + H2O.
CA   (2) 1,1'-dihydroxy-1,1',2,2'-tetrahydrolycopene = rhodopin + H2O.
CC   -!- In Rubrivivax gelatinosus and Thiocapsa roseopersicina both products
