CC   -!- Acts on chondroitin 4-sulfate and chondroitin 6-sulfate, but less
CC       well on hyaluronate.
CC   -!- In general, chondroitin sulfate (CS) and dermatan sulfate (DS) chains
CC       comprise a linkage region, a chain cap and a repeat region.
