CC       acid (GlcA) and N-acetylgalactosamine (GalNAc) [-4)GlcA(beta1-
CC       3)GalNAc(beta1-]n, which may be O-sulfated on the C-4 and/or C-6 of
CC       GalNAc and C-2 of GlcA.
