//
ID   4.2.3.5
DE   chorismate synthase.
AN   5-enolpyruvylshikimate-3-phosphate phospholyase.
CA   5-O-(1-carboxyvinyl)-3-phosphoshikimate = chorismate + phosphate.
CC   -!- The reaction goes via a radical mechanism that involves reduced FMN
CC       and its semiquinone (FMNH.).
CC   -!- Shikimate is numbered so that the double-bond is between C-1 and C-2,
CC       but some earlier papers numbered the ring in the reverse direction.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 4.6.1.4.
