//
ID   4.2.3.53
DE   (+)-endo-beta-bergamotene synthase [(2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate
DE   cyclizing].
CA   (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate = (+)-endo-beta-bergamotene + diphosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme synthesizes a mixture of sesquiterpenoids from (2Z,6Z)-
CC       farnesyl diphosphate.
CC   -!- Following dephosphorylation of (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate,
CC       the (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl carbocation is converted to either the (6R)- or
CC       the (6S)-bisabolyl cations depending on the stereochemistry of the
CC       6,1 closure.
CC   -!- The (6R)-bisabolyl cation will then lead to the formation of (+)-
CC       alpha-santalene (see EC 4.2.3.50), while the (6S)-bisabolyl cation
CC       will give rise to (-)-endo-alpha-bergamotene (see EC 4.2.3.54),
CC       as well as (+)-endo-beta-bergamotene.
CC   -!- Small amounts of (-)-epi-beta-santalene are also formed from the
CC       (6R)-bisabolyl cation and small amounts of (-)-exo-alpha-bergamotene
CC       are formed from the (6S)-bisabolyl cation.
DR   B8XA41, SBS_SOLHA  ;
//
ID   4.2.3.54
DE   (-)-endo-alpha-bergamotene synthase [(2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate
DE   cyclizing].
CA   (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate = (1S,5S,6S)-alpha-bergamotene +
CA   diphosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme synthesizes a mixture of sesquiterpenoids from (2Z,6Z)-
CC       farnesyl diphosphate.
CC   -!- Following dephosphorylation of (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl diphosphate,
CC       the (2Z,6Z)-farnesyl carbocation is converted to either the (6R)- or
CC       the (6S)-bisabolyl cations depending on the stereochemistry of the
CC       6,1 closure.
CC   -!- The (6R)-bisabolyl cation will then lead to the formation of (+)-
CC       alpha-santalene (see EC 4.2.3.50), while the (6S)-bisabolyl cation
CC       will give rise to (+)-endo-beta-bergamotene (EC 4.2.3.53) as well as
CC       (-)-endo-alpha-bergamotene.
CC   -!- Small amounts of (-)-epi-beta-santalene are also formed from the
CC       (6R)-bisabolyl cation and small amounts of (-)-exo-alpha-bergamotene
CC       are formed from the (6S)-bisabolyl cation.
DR   B8XA41, SBS_SOLHA  ;  G8H5N0, TPS17_SOLHA;  G5CV52, TPS17_SOLLC;
DR   Q6JD70, TPS5A_MAIZE;
//
ID   4.2.3.55
DE   (S)-beta-bisabolene synthase.
CA   (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate = (S)-beta-bisabolene + diphosphate.
CC   -!- The synthesis of (S)-beta-macrocarpene from (2E,6E)-farnesyl
CC       diphosphate proceeds in two steps.
CC   -!- The first step is the cyclization to (S)-beta-bisabolene.
CC   -!- The second step is the isomerization to (S)-beta-macrocarpene (cf.
CC       EC 5.5.1.17, (S)-beta-macrocarpene synthase).
DR   Q4KSH9, BARS_ARATH ;  D2YZP9, BISS_ZINOF ;  Q2NM15, FARS_MAIZE ;
DR   Q1EG72, TPS11_MAIZE;  Q6JD73, TPS4A_MAIZE;  Q6JD70, TPS5A_MAIZE;
DR   Q5GJ60, TPS6_MAIZE ;  U5PZT6, TPS8_HEDCO ;
