ID   4.2.99.18
DE   DNA-(apurinic or apyrimidinic site) lyase.
AN   AP endonuclease class I.
AN   AP lyase.
AN   deoxyribonuclease (apurinic or apyrimidinic).
AN   E.coli endonuclease III.
AN   endodeoxyribonuclease (apurinic or apyrimidinic).
AN   Micrococcus luteus UV endonuclease.
AN   phage-T4 UV endonuclease.
CA   2'-deoxyribonucleotide-(2'-deoxyribose 5'-phosphate)-
CA   2'-deoxyribonucleotide-DNA = a 3'-end 2'-deoxyribonucleotide-(2,3-
CA   dehydro-2,3-deoxyribose 5'-phosphate)-DNA + a 5'-end 5'-phospho-
CA   2'-deoxyribonucleoside-DNA + H(+).
CC   -!- 'Nicking' of the phosphodiester bond is due to a lyase-type reaction,
CC       not hydrolysis.
CC   -!- This group of enzymes was previously listed as endonucleases, under
CC       the number EC 3.1.25.2.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.1.25.2.
