ID   4.3.1.16
DE   threo-3-hydroxy-L-aspartate ammonia-lyase.
AN   L-threo-3-hydroxyaspartate dehydratase.
AN   threo-3-hydroxyaspartate dehydratase.
CA   (3S)-3-hydroxy-L-aspartate = oxaloacetate + NH4(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, purified from the bacterium Pseudomonas sp. T62,
CC       is highly specific, and does not accept any other stereoisomer of
CC       3-hydroxyaspartate.
CC   -!- Different from EC 4.3.1.20 and EC 4.3.1.27.
CC   -!- Requires a divalent cation such as Mn(2+), Mg(2+), or Ca(2+).
