DE   purine imidazole-ring cyclase.
CA   DNA 4,6-diamino-5-formamidopyrimidine = DNA adenine + H2O.
CC   -!- Also acts on 2,6-diamino-5-formamido-3,4-dihydro-4-oxopyrimidine
CC       residues.
CC   -!- Brings about the reclosure of the imidazole rings of purine residues
CC       damaged by gamma-rays.
