ID   4.3.2.5
DE   peptidylamidoglycolate lyase.
AN   alpha-hydroxyglycine amidating dealkylase.
CA   a [peptide]-C-terminal (2S)-2-hydroxyglycine = a [peptide]-C-terminal
CA   amide + glyoxylate.
CC   -!- Acts on the product of the reaction catalyzed by EC 1.14.17.3, thus
CC       removing a terminal glycine residue and leaving a des-glycine peptide
CC       amide.
