ID   4.3.99.3
DE   7-carboxy-7-deazaguanine synthase.
AN   7-carboxy-7-carbaguanine synthase.
CA   6-carboxy-5,6,7,8-tetrahydropterin + H(+) = 7-carboxy-7-carbaguanine +
CA   NH4(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is a member of the superfamily of S-adenosyl-L-methionine-
CC       dependent radical (radical AdoMet) enzymes.
CC   -!- Binds a [4Fe-4S] cluster that is coordinated by 3 cysteines and an
CC       exchangeable S-adenosyl-L-methionine molecule.
CC   -!- The S-adenosyl-L-methionine is catalytic as it is regenerated at the
CC       end of the reaction.
CC   -!- The reaction is part of the biosynthesis pathway of queuosine.
