ID   4.6.1.13
DE   phosphatidylinositol diacylglycerol-lyase.
AN   1-phosphatidylinositol phosphodiesterase.
AN   monophosphatidylinositol phosphodiesterase.
AN   phosphatidylinositol phospholipase C.
CA   a 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycero-3-phospho-(1D-myo-inositol) = 1D-myo-inositol
CA   1,2-cyclic phosphate + a 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycerol.
CC   -!- This enzyme is bacterial.
CC   -!- Activity is also found in animals, but this activity is due to the
CC       presence of EC 3.1.4.11.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.1.4.10.
