ID   4.99.1.2
DE   alkylmercury lyase.
AN   organomercurial lyase.
AN   organomercury lyase.
CA   an alkylmercury + H(+) = an alkane + Hg(2+).
CC   -!- Acts on CH3Hg(+) and a number of other alkylmercury compounds, in the
CC       presence of cysteine or other thiols, liberating mercury as a
CC       mercaptide.
