ID   5.1.1.13
DE   aspartate racemase.
CA   L-aspartate = D-aspartate.
CC   -!- Also acts, at half the rate, on L-alanine.
DR   O68008, BACC_BACLI ;  P83989, RACD_ANABR ;  P29079, RACD_ENTFC ;
DR   H8L901, RACD_ENTFU ;  O58403, RACD_PYRHO ;  O93779, RACD_THEK8 ;
