DE   alpha-methylacyl-CoA racemase.
CA   a (2S)-2-methylacyl-CoA = a (2R)-2-methylacyl-CoA.
CC   -!- alpha-methyl-branched acyl-CoA derivatives with chain lengths of more
CC       than C10 are substrates.
