DE   (+)-bornyl diphosphate synthase.
AN   bornyl pyrophosphate synthase.
AN   bornyl pyrophosphate synthetase.
AN   geranyl-diphosphate cyclase.
CA   (2E)-geranyl diphosphate = (2S,4R)-bornyl diphosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Salvia officinalis (sage) can also use (3R)-linalyl
CC       diphosphate or more slowly neryl diphosphate in vitro.
CC   -!- The reaction proceeds via isomeration of geranyl diphosphate to (3R)-
CC       linalyl diphosphate.
CC   -!- The oxygen and phosphorus originally linked to C-1 of geranyl
CC       diphosphate end up linked to C-2 of (+)-bornyl diphosphate. cf.
CC       EC 5.5.1.22.
