ID   5.6.2.2
DE   DNA topoisomerase (ATP-hydrolyzing).
AN   DNA gyrase.
AN   DNA topoisomerase II.
AN   type II DNA topoisomerase.
CA   ATP-dependent breakage, passage and rejoining of double-stranded DNA.
CC   -!- The enzyme can introduce negative superhelical turns into double-
CC       stranded circular DNA.
CC   -!- One unit has nicking-closing activity, and another catalyzes super-
CC       twisting and hydrolysis of ATP (cf. EC 5.6.2.2).
CC   -!- Formerly EC 5.99.1.3.
