DE   Transferred entry: 5.6.2.2.
//
ID   5.99.1.4
DE   2-hydroxychromene-2-carboxylate isomerase.
AN   2HC2CA isomerase.
AN   HCCA isomerase.
CA   2-hydroxychromene-2-carboxylate = (3E)-4-(2-hydroxyphenyl)-2-oxobut-3-
CA   enoate.
CC   -!- This enzyme is involved in naphthalene degradation.
DR   Q51948, NAHD_PSEPU ;  Q52462, NAHD_PSEU8 ;  Q9X9Q7, NSAD_SPHXE ;
