AN   tyrosine-transfer ribonucleate synthetase.
AN   tyrosine-transfer RNA ligase.
AN   tyrosine translase.
AN   tyrosine tRNA synthetase.
AN   tyrosyl-transfer ribonucleate synthetase.
AN   tyrosyl-transfer ribonucleic acid synthetase.
AN   tyrosyl-transfer RNA synthetase.
AN   tyrosyl-tRNA ligase.
AN   tyrosyl-tRNA synthetase.
CA   tRNA(Tyr) + L-tyrosine + ATP = L-tyrosyl-tRNA(Tyr) + AMP + diphosphate +
CA   H(+).
