ID   6.3.1.15
DE   8-demethylnovobiocic acid synthase.
AN   8-demethylnovobiocic acid synthetase.
AN   novobiocin ligase.
CA   3-amino-4,7-dihydroxycoumarin + 3-dimethylallyl-4-hydroxybenzoate + ATP =
CA   8-desmethylnovobiocic acid + AMP + diphosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of the aminocoumarin
CC       antibiotic novobiocin.
DR   Q9L9F6, NOVL_STRNV ;
