ID   6.3.1.17
DE   beta-citrylglutamate synthase.
AN   NAAGS-I.
AN   NAAG synthetase I.
CA   citrate + L-glutamate + ATP = beta-citrylglutamate + ADP + phosphate +
CA   H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in animals, also has the activity of EC 6.3.2.41.
DR   Q0VCE9, RIMKB_BOVIN;  Q66HZ2, RIMKB_DANRE;  Q9ULI2, RIMKB_HUMAN;
DR   Q80WS1, RIMKB_MOUSE;
//
ID   6.3.1.18
DE   gamma-glutamylanilide synthase.
CA   aniline + L-glutamate + ATP = N(5)-phenyl-L-glutamine + ADP + phosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Acinetobacter sp. YAA,
CC       catalyzes the first step in the degradation of aniline.
CC   -!- It can also accept chlorinated and methylated forms of aniline,
CC       preferrably in the o- and p-positions.
DR   Q44249, ATDA1_ACISP;
