CC       catalyzes a similar tRNA modification to that performed by
CC       EC 2.3.1.193.
CC   -!- However, unlike that enzyme, which uses acetyl-CoA as the acetyl
CC       donor, this enzyme activates an acetate ion to form acetyladenylate
CC       and then catalyzes the acetylation through a mechanism similar to
CC       tRNA aminoacylation.
