ID   6.3.5.12
DE   Ni-sirohydrochlorin a,c-diamide synthase.
CA   Ni-sirohydrochlorin + 2 L-glutamine + 2 ATP + 2 H2O = Ni-sirohydrochlorin
CA   a,c-diamide + 2 L-glutamate + 2 ADP + 2 phosphate + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme, studied from the methanogenic archaeon Methanosarcina
CC       acetivorans, participates in the biosynthesis of the nickel-
CC       containing tetrapyrrole cofactor coenzyme F430, which is required by
CC       EC 2.8.4.1.
