CA   H(+).
CC   -!- This enzyme is a multi-domain polypeptide that catalyzes three
CC       different activities - a biotin carboxyl-carrier protein (BCCP),
CC       a biotin carboxylase that catalyzes the transfer of a carboxyl group
CC       from hydrogencarbonate to the biotin molecule carried by the carrier
CC       protein, and the transfer of the carboxyl group from biotin to
CC       acetyl-CoA, forming malonyl-CoA.
