DE   2-oxoglutarate carboxylase.
AN   carboxylating factor for ICDH.
AN   CFI.
AN   OGC.
AN   oxalosuccinate synthetase.
CA   hydrogencarbonate + 2-oxoglutarate + ATP = (S)-oxalosuccinate + ADP +
CA   phosphate + H(+).
CC   -!- It was originally thought that this enzyme was a promoting factor for
CC       the carboxylation of 2-oxoglutarate by EC 1.1.1.41, but this has
