ID   6.4.1.8
DE   acetophenone carboxylase.
CA   acetophenone + hydrogencarbonate + 2 ATP + H2O = 3-oxo-3-phenylpropanoate
CA   + 2 ADP + 2 phosphate + 2 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in anaerobic degradation of ethylbenzene.
CC   -!- No activity with acetone, butanone, 4-hydroxy-acetophenone or
CC       4-amino-acetophenone.
