DE   ABC-type oligosaccharide transporter.
AN   oligosaccharide-transporting ATPase.
CA   ATP + H2O + oligosaccharide-[oligosaccharide-binding protein]Side 1 =
CA   ADP + phosphate + oligosaccharideSide 2 + [oligosaccharide-binding
CA   protein]Side 1.
CC   -!- An ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the
